(2560994, 353926, 60905, '<td valign="top">this is a beautiful image, it has a wonderful crisp clear focus, and it is in good lighting, i really love the closeup, would like to see a bit more creativity though with this.<br/>that is just me and it is an individual comment, not meant to offend. you still did a lovely job on this one.</td>', 'this is a beautiful image, it has a wonderful crisp clear focus, and it is in good lighting, i really love the closeup, would like to see a bit more creativity though with this.that is just me and it is an individual comment, not meant to offend. you still did a lovely job on this one.', '2006-06-28 08:26:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2561000, 354277, 38492, '<td valign="top">A closer shot of the eagle might have suited the title better. There''s a pleasing symmetry at work, but the subject is poorly lit - there are a lot of odd reflections at work here, and the paperweight doesn''t stand out against its background.</td>', 'A closer shot of the eagle might have suited the title better. There''s a pleasing symmetry at work, but the subject is poorly lit - there are a lot of odd reflections at work here, and the paperweight doesn''t stand out against its background.', '2006-06-28 08:27:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2561004, 353044, 60905, '<td valign="top">This is quite creative and very well framed cept for two things, i think you could afford to crop down a bit from the top, and a bit from the bottom, some say the blur at the bottom is a good thing, others say it is not, i for one find it useful in some instances, but this one, i think would be much better without that much blur down below, the eye is not going right to the treasure when this loads due to so much at the top.<br/>this still is very well composed! thanx for sharing.</td>', 'This is quite creative and very well framed cept for two things, i think you could afford to crop down a bit from the top, and a bit from the bottom, some say the blur at the bottom is a good thing, others say it is not, i for one find it useful in some instances, but this one, i think would be much better without that much blur down below, the eye is not going right to the treasure when this loads due to so much at the top.this still is very well composed! thanx for sharing.', '2006-06-28 08:28:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2561011, 354319, 60905, '<td valign="top">This is very beautiful and extremly challenging, the lighting is nice but could be better to give you more depth to your red glass surrounding the white beauty! i think if you had more definition it would give more depth and more character to the white glass that is the star.<br/>the lighting in the front is almost to much, yet at the top of the pic is quite dark. Not to offend as still this is quite a nice shot.<br/>thank you for sharing.</td>', 'This is very beautiful and extremly challenging, the lighting is nice but could be better to give you more depth to your red glass surrounding the white beauty! i think if you had more definition it would give more depth and more character to the white glass that is the star.the lighting in the front is almost to much, yet at the top of the pic is quite dark. Not to offend as still this is quite a nice shot.thank you for sharing.', '2006-06-28 08:30:32.000000', NULL, 1),
