(2561089, 354698, 31533, '<td valign="top">Good prop !<br/>The image lacks a bit of detail, I would have composed to show the innards of the bulb. I like the blue hue. Good luck.</td>', 'Good prop !The image lacks a bit of detail, I would have composed to show the innards of the bulb. I like the blue hue. Good luck.', '2006-06-28 08:54:25.000000', NULL, 1),
