(2561465, 353260, 40679, '<td valign="top">At first I thought there was a bit too much noise, but after looking at your entry a bit longer, I like it! the reflection in the glass ball is great, and the water really fits this photo. maybe you could''ve put the ball a bit more to the top or bottom to get that 1/3 rule.</td>', 'At first I thought there was a bit too much noise, but after looking at your entry a bit longer, I like it! the reflection in the glass ball is great, and the water really fits this photo. maybe you could''ve put the ball a bit more to the top or bottom to get that 1/3 rule.', '2006-06-28 10:39:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2561468, 352845, 19670, '<td valign="top">This might have been better if it was cropped across the top where the plain ceiling begins (to eliminate the smoke alarms). Maybe crop out the car, too. Since there''s not much color, this may have benefitted from being made into a black and white.</td>', 'This might have been better if it was cropped across the top where the plain ceiling begins (to eliminate the smoke alarms). Maybe crop out the car, too. Since there''s not much color, this may have benefitted from being made into a black and white.', '2006-06-28 10:40:58.000000', NULL, 1),
