(2561478, 354346, 34192, '<td valign="top">This image intrigued me.  I realy like it.  But (don''t you hate that?)  with a slight curves adjustment to really bring out the color and a slight sharpening to bring out the shapes and pop the color, this would be an "I Love it" shot.  Very interesting as is but just a little flat. 7</td>', 'This image intrigued me.  I realy like it.  But (don''t you hate that?)  with a slight curves adjustment to really bring out the color and a slight sharpening to bring out the shapes and pop the color, this would be an "I Love it" shot.  Very interesting as is but just a little flat. 7', '2006-06-28 10:43:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2561479, 354708, 60862, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.</td>', 'Nice idea.', '2006-06-28 10:44:17.000000', NULL, 1),
