(2561487, 354640, 60862, '<td valign="top">Wow.  Pretty and visually fascinating.  Is that oil? I''m wondering how you got the surface so calm.  Hope for your health it isn''t mercury! 9</td>', 'Wow.  Pretty and visually fascinating.  Is that oil? I''m wondering how you got the surface so calm.  Hope for your health it isn''t mercury! 9', '2006-06-28 10:47:07.000000', NULL, 1),
