(2562124, 354689, 47704, '<td valign="top">Thank you.  With so much CRAP in this challenge I finally found my 10.  I love this.  This probably won''t win a ribbon because most voters on here will vote the cheesy stuff high.  But this is wonderful and would look great in B&amp;W too.</td>', 'Thank you.  With so much CRAP in this challenge I finally found my 10.  I love this.  This probably won''t win a ribbon because most voters on here will vote the cheesy stuff high.  But this is wonderful and would look great in B&W too.', '2006-06-28 13:23:27.000000', NULL, 1),
