(2563360, 353424, 42495, '<td valign="top">Different take on "glass" and I like it, especially the composition.  Hopefully you won''t get too many reduced scores for DNMC.  Mirror is certainly glass.</td>', 'Different take on "glass" and I like it, especially the composition.  Hopefully you won''t get too many reduced scores for DNMC.  Mirror is certainly glass.', '2006-06-28 18:41:58.000000', NULL, 1),
