(2563489, 353439, 41337, '<td valign="top">I was thinking about shooting this myself since I had one lying around but then I realized it had liquid in it and probably would be considered DNMC. Hopefully you aren''t getting hit too hard with that. Other than that I think you shot it well and you put some thought into it.</td>', 'I was thinking about shooting this myself since I had one lying around but then I realized it had liquid in it and probably would be considered DNMC. Hopefully you aren''t getting hit too hard with that. Other than that I think you shot it well and you put some thought into it.', '2006-06-28 19:09:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2563490, 354089, 24454, '<td valign="top">Ok. . .I''ve decided:  This one needs to be a ribbon winner!  This is so creative and cute!  There are way way toooooooo many photos of glass figurines here!  But this one is refreshing, awesome, and I hope it is getting top votes!!!</td>', 'Ok. . .I''ve decided:  This one needs to be a ribbon winner!  This is so creative and cute!  There are way way toooooooo many photos of glass figurines here!  But this one is refreshing, awesome, and I hope it is getting top votes!!!', '2006-06-28 19:09:41.000000', NULL, 1),
