(2563540, 354506, 8860, '<td valign="top">Starkly captivating image. Something is slightly awkward here but I don;t know what it is - perhaps it''s the non-perpendicular uprights. I do like the textures here and your choice of subject.</td>', 'Starkly captivating image. Something is slightly awkward here but I don;t know what it is - perhaps it''s the non-perpendicular uprights. I do like the textures here and your choice of subject.', '2006-06-28 19:20:31.000000', NULL, 1),
