(2563791, 354548, 9083, '<td valign="top">I wish the crop wasn''t so tight at the bottom.  Good strong image with lovely contrasting colours</td>', 'I wish the crop wasn''t so tight at the bottom.  Good strong image with lovely contrasting colours', '2006-06-28 20:17:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2563792, 354546, 36382, '<td valign="top">This is my favorite for this challenge.  The dirty glass, the black and white treatment and the interesting faces all make for a wonderful image.  In fact, I am starting to think that this might be one of the best images I''ve ever seen.  I wouldn''t be surprised to see a picture like this in one of those coffee table books about famous photographers.  Sorry for gushing, but I do think it is brilliant.</td>', 'This is my favorite for this challenge.  The dirty glass, the black and white treatment and the interesting faces all make for a wonderful image.  In fact, I am starting to think that this might be one of the best images I''ve ever seen.  I wouldn''t be surprised to see a picture like this in one of those coffee table books about famous photographers.  Sorry for gushing, but I do think it is brilliant.', '2006-06-28 20:17:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2563798, 354009, 51802, '<td valign="top">I am guessing that you sprayed water on a mirror for the background effect.  This mirror image of each drop caused the shot to look like it is very much out of focus when in fact it is not.  I think larger water drops would help improve this a lot.</td>', 'I am guessing that you sprayed water on a mirror for the background effect.  This mirror image of each drop caused the shot to look like it is very much out of focus when in fact it is not.  I think larger water drops would help improve this a lot.', '2006-06-28 20:19:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2563811, 354022, 36382, '<td valign="top">nice sharpness and nice tones 10</td>', 'nice sharpness and nice tones 10', '2006-06-28 20:22:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2563812, 353939, 36382, '<td valign="top">I think the liquid could have been a bit sharper, but I like everything else about this image, especially the muted colors.</td>', 'I think the liquid could have been a bit sharper, but I like everything else about this image, especially the muted colors.', '2006-06-28 20:22:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2563848, 354124, 45475, '<td valign="top">Ummmmm........ ok, this could have beeen improved by softer lighting, more contrast and cropping down to under the subject''s bustline...</td>', 'Ummmmm........ ok, this could have beeen improved by softer lighting, more contrast and cropping down to under the subject''s bustline...', '2006-06-28 20:34:11.000000', NULL, 1),
