(2563855, 354640, 36382, '<td valign="top">Nice sharpness on the glass.  The fingers through the glass look good.  Nice colors.  Only nitpick is that the skin looks a bit yellow.  I still really like it.</td>', 'Nice sharpness on the glass.  The fingers through the glass look good.  Nice colors.  Only nitpick is that the skin looks a bit yellow.  I still really like it.', '2006-06-28 20:35:33.000000', NULL, 1),
