(2564489, 354657, 59335, '<td valign="top">I''ve seen this a few times in this challenge, and everybody seems to cast one solid color light over the entire chessboard.  I think it would be much better with a spot on the fallen king, red is a good warm color, and then perhaps a cool color like a blue surrounding the rest of the board...</td>', 'I''ve seen this a few times in this challenge, and everybody seems to cast one solid color light over the entire chessboard.  I think it would be much better with a spot on the fallen king, red is a good warm color, and then perhaps a cool color like a blue surrounding the rest of the board...', '2006-06-29 00:06:07.000000', NULL, 1),
