(2564852, 354291, 46336, '<td valign="top">First up - I love the colours; really rich and vibrant. The object in the centre does not stand out sufficiently well to be a distinct focal subject. The net impact is that the whole is just too busy.</td>', 'First up - I love the colours; really rich and vibrant. The object in the centre does not stand out sufficiently well to be a distinct focal subject. The net impact is that the whole is just too busy.', '2006-06-29 01:59:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2564853, 354435, 45475, '<td valign="top">The composition would have been dramatically improved if you had more of the subject''s profile in this. It''s dark but does not seem to convey any mood. Although you probably put a great deal of thought and effort into this, it just doesn''t look like it to me. Sorry... :(</td>', 'The composition would have been dramatically improved if you had more of the subject''s profile in this. It''s dark but does not seem to convey any mood. Although you probably put a great deal of thought and effort into this, it just doesn''t look like it to me. Sorry... :(', '2006-06-29 02:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2564854, 351326, 46336, '<td valign="top">Nice and simple. Just my opinion but I think this would have worked even better with the marble even more off-centre (further to the left). I would also like to have seen the marble and its reflection to be more distinct. Still, I do like it.</td>', 'Nice and simple. Just my opinion but I think this would have worked even better with the marble even more off-centre (further to the left). I would also like to have seen the marble and its reflection to be more distinct. Still, I do like it.', '2006-06-29 02:02:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2564857, 353993, 45475, '<td valign="top">The colours are washed out because the exposure wasn''t quite right. At least the sky in the reflection looks good :)</td>', 'The colours are washed out because the exposure wasn''t quite right. At least the sky in the reflection looks good :)', '2006-06-29 02:03:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2564860, 353273, 54172, '<td valign="top">Nice background.</td>', 'Nice background.', '2006-06-29 02:03:57.000000', NULL, 1),
