(2564863, 354067, 46336, '<td valign="top">Very clever. This shot has fantastic ''pop''. In terms of composition I think it would have worked better if the light hadn''t run off the top jof the image (maybe covered with a bit of black cloth). Otherwise it seems you have achived exactly what you set out to with this image.</td>', 'Very clever. This shot has fantastic ''pop''. In terms of composition I think it would have worked better if the light hadn''t run off the top jof the image (maybe covered with a bit of black cloth). Otherwise it seems you have achived exactly what you set out to with this image.', '2006-06-29 02:05:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2564865, 353044, 51799, '<td valign="top">I would have rated it higher with fewer "props" surrounding it.  The kelp (?) and feather are distracting for me.</td>', 'I would have rated it higher with fewer "props" surrounding it.  The kelp (?) and feather are distracting for me.', '2006-06-29 02:06:13.000000', NULL, 1),
