(2564870, 354322, 45475, '<td valign="top">The challenge is about "creatively" shooting glass, not just shooting "creative glass"... I''m sorry, I don''t mean to sound rude. In any event, as lovely as this stained glass window is, the exposure is still not quite right.... :( Nice try though...</td>', 'The challenge is about "creatively" shooting glass, not just shooting "creative glass"... I''m sorry, I don''t mean to sound rude. In any event, as lovely as this stained glass window is, the exposure is still not quite right.... :( Nice try though...', '2006-06-29 02:09:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2564872, 352532, 46336, '<td valign="top">What the? My word that is complex. The lighting and setting is absolutely superb. The only thing I can say is that the glass structure is so complex and busy that it is hard to say where to look.</td>', 'What the? My word that is complex. The lighting and setting is absolutely superb. The only thing I can say is that the glass structure is so complex and busy that it is hard to say where to look.', '2006-06-29 02:09:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2564880, 353908, 45475, '<td valign="top">Just not enough importance being placed on the glass... What I''m getting from this is spiritual light. Don''t get me wrong, it''s a great photo! But as far as this challenge goes, I just can''t seem to make it connect... sorry :(</td>', 'Just not enough importance being placed on the glass... What I''m getting from this is spiritual light. Don''t get me wrong, it''s a great photo! But as far as this challenge goes, I just can''t seem to make it connect... sorry :(', '2006-06-29 02:11:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2564891, 354073, 46336, '<td valign="top">Beautiful eggs. As this shot stands I find it very flat. I would love to see the following things in this shot - less noise on the eggs and background, more distinction between the eggs and the background surface, and for the full shadows from the eggs to be included in the picture.</td>', 'Beautiful eggs. As this shot stands I find it very flat. I would love to see the following things in this shot - less noise on the eggs and background, more distinction between the eggs and the background surface, and for the full shadows from the eggs to be included in the picture.', '2006-06-29 02:14:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2564896, 354084, 57, '<td valign="top">would like to see a sharper focus somewhere in this image (the middle section is sharpest, but it is still kinda blurry) to create a focal point, but love the colors!</td>', 'would like to see a sharper focus somewhere in this image (the middle section is sharpest, but it is still kinda blurry) to create a focal point, but love the colors!', '2006-06-29 02:18:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2564899, 354610, 57, '<td valign="top">background leaves something to be desired, but the lighting on the frog and the translucence is nice.</td>', 'background leaves something to be desired, but the lighting on the frog and the translucence is nice.', '2006-06-29 02:19:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2564909, 354420, 57726, '<td valign="top">Good clarity, colour.</td>', 'Good clarity, colour.', '2006-06-29 02:25:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2564915, 354102, 45475, '<td valign="top">I''m not really sure how to put this without offending you :( I mean, the colours are lovely and the dof is good, but the image as a whole in relation to the challenge, is dull and uninspiring. I''m terribly sorry if I come off sounding mean, but I thought you may want to know why I''ve rated this way...</td>', 'I''m not really sure how to put this without offending you :( I mean, the colours are lovely and the dof is good, but the image as a whole in relation to the challenge, is dull and uninspiring. I''m terribly sorry if I come off sounding mean, but I thought you may want to know why I''ve rated this way...', '2006-06-29 02:27:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2564920, 353881, 45475, '<td valign="top">Either soft focus or motion blur is making this image difficult to look at. I''m terribly sorry... :(</td>', 'Either soft focus or motion blur is making this image difficult to look at. I''m terribly sorry... :(', '2006-06-29 02:30:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2564929, 353044, 57, '<td valign="top">would have liked this even better without the feather and whatnot, just the glass ball with sand/pebbles.  still, very nice...</td>', 'would have liked this even better without the feather and whatnot, just the glass ball with sand/pebbles.  still, very nice...', '2006-06-29 02:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
