(2566102, 354535, 27482, '<td valign="top">Lol!  Very creative, I would suggest you get in closer next time and try to find a better composition/viewpoint, this seems poorly thought out and very "snapshot-ishly" composed.</td>', 'Lol!  Very creative, I would suggest you get in closer next time and try to find a better composition/viewpoint, this seems poorly thought out and very "snapshot-ishly" composed.', '2006-06-29 12:51:41.000000', NULL, 1),
