(2566109, 353934, 27482, '<td valign="top">Sorry but way too dark for my taste, hard to make anything out.  And yes, my screen is calibrated...</td>', 'Sorry but way too dark for my taste, hard to make anything out.  And yes, my screen is calibrated...', '2006-06-29 12:53:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2566111, 354405, 50641, '<td valign="top">This is cool but I wish I could see better detail of the reflection.  Maybe could have cropped closer.  Also, perhaps could increase the contrast so that the blacks and whites of the reflection are more striking.</td>', 'This is cool but I wish I could see better detail of the reflection.  Maybe could have cropped closer.  Also, perhaps could increase the contrast so that the blacks and whites of the reflection are more striking.', '2006-06-29 12:53:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2566117, 354015, 27482, '<td valign="top">Not bad but I think this should have been taken at another time of day so that you could have had a blue sky to the left or a sunset/sunrise reflected in the glass, the blown out sky doesn´t really do it for me.</td>', 'Not bad but I think this should have been taken at another time of day so that you could have had a blue sky to the left or a sunset/sunrise reflected in the glass, the blown out sky doesn´t really do it for me.', '2006-06-29 12:54:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2566124, 352759, 61245, '<td valign="top">I know someone who has almost the same picture :o)))</td>', 'I know someone who has almost the same picture :o)))', '2006-06-29 12:56:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2566127, 354535, 50641, '<td valign="top">Bizarre, which is good, but perhaps you might have further cultivated this idea (planting rows of bulbs might be interesting, for example).  Also, consider getting closer to your subject.</td>', 'Bizarre, which is good, but perhaps you might have further cultivated this idea (planting rows of bulbs might be interesting, for example).  Also, consider getting closer to your subject.', '2006-06-29 12:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2566130, 352759, 50641, '<td valign="top">Cool shot.  Larger image would be even better.</td>', 'Cool shot.  Larger image would be even better.', '2006-06-29 12:58:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2566148, 353223, 58469, '<td valign="top">I like the image in general, and I enjoy seeing the hands on the glass. But I''m having trouble connecting with the subject - which I think is due to his expression and the fact that he''s distracted by something above him.</td>', 'I like the image in general, and I enjoy seeing the hands on the glass. But I''m having trouble connecting with the subject - which I think is due to his expression and the fact that he''s distracted by something above him.', '2006-06-29 13:04:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2566149, 354271, 58469, '<td valign="top">I love the colors. That''s quite a collection of glass!</td>', 'I love the colors. That''s quite a collection of glass!', '2006-06-29 13:04:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2566156, 353030, 58469, '<td valign="top">DOF and the primary colors are nice, but the harsh glare is a problem for me.</td>', 'DOF and the primary colors are nice, but the harsh glare is a problem for me.', '2006-06-29 13:06:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2566161, 354746, 58469, '<td valign="top">Great choice making it black and white. Also, I like the connection with the subject and I think that the grain/noise works perfectly with this image.</td>', 'Great choice making it black and white. Also, I like the connection with the subject and I think that the grain/noise works perfectly with this image.', '2006-06-29 13:07:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2566177, 353398, 58469, '<td valign="top">I think that a different POV may have helped this image. The pattern in the glass is fairly interesting, but because door nobs are so common, I think it would be hard to get a really captivating image of one.</td>', 'I think that a different POV may have helped this image. The pattern in the glass is fairly interesting, but because door nobs are so common, I think it would be hard to get a really captivating image of one.', '2006-06-29 13:10:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2566184, 352714, 58469, '<td valign="top">I like the POV and the texture. The only thing I might like seeing would be a bit more of an overexposed image. It might have a pleasant effect. The green in the corner is a little bit distracting as well, and I''m not sure where it''s comming from.</td>', 'I like the POV and the texture. The only thing I might like seeing would be a bit more of an overexposed image. It might have a pleasant effect. The green in the corner is a little bit distracting as well, and I''m not sure where it''s comming from.', '2006-06-29 13:12:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2566190, 352830, 58469, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition, but the fact that the image is not very sharp is what detracts from the photograph.</td>', 'Interesting composition, but the fact that the image is not very sharp is what detracts from the photograph.', '2006-06-29 13:14:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2566194, 354075, 27482, '<td valign="top">Excellent work, not a thing I would change about it except for if it were edited in advanced editing, I would have made the yellow metal part of the bulb yellow again and not had it with such a strong green hue but in basic editing, this is perfect.  Still "only" gave it an 8, not really a wow image for me but I would not be surprised to see this ribbon, it´s awesome work on all the technicals.</td>', 'Excellent work, not a thing I would change about it except for if it were edited in advanced editing, I would have made the yellow metal part of the bulb yellow again and not had it with such a strong green hue but in basic editing, this is perfect.  Still "only" gave it an 8, not really a wow image for me but I would not be surprised to see this ribbon, it´s awesome work on all the technicals.', '2006-06-29 13:15:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2566198, 354763, 58469, '<td valign="top">Love the composition and the feeling the image portrays. The only way I think the image could be improved would be to remove the vertical lines that are semi-transparent. I''m not sure if that''s even possible with whatever setup you used. Overall, great image.</td>', 'Love the composition and the feeling the image portrays. The only way I think the image could be improved would be to remove the vertical lines that are semi-transparent. I''m not sure if that''s even possible with whatever setup you used. Overall, great image.', '2006-06-29 13:16:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2566201, 353273, 27482, '<td valign="top">I love the simplicity in this shot, just so elequently not trying to be more than it is and that is what makes it work.  I am not too fond of the composition though, would have had the "horizon" lower int he frame and the orbs more in the lower right corner if I had taken this, I gave this an 7.</td>', 'I love the simplicity in this shot, just so elequently not trying to be more than it is and that is what makes it work.  I am not too fond of the composition though, would have had the "horizon" lower int he frame and the orbs more in the lower right corner if I had taken this, I gave this an 7.', '2006-06-29 13:17:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2566203, 353223, 27482, '<td valign="top">Lol!  So cute!</td>', 'Lol!  So cute!', '2006-06-29 13:17:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2566207, 352390, 58469, '<td valign="top">Haha, as a chess lover, I can appreaciate this one. I like the green light. What I''m unsure about is what was supposed to be the main subject of this image.</td>', 'Haha, as a chess lover, I can appreaciate this one. I like the green light. What I''m unsure about is what was supposed to be the main subject of this image.', '2006-06-29 13:18:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2566208, 352718, 27482, '<td valign="top">I don´t know why but it bothers me that you have all that space to the left and then don´t include the whole coin in the frame, just don´t think it "looks right" sort of.</td>', 'I don´t know why but it bothers me that you have all that space to the left and then don´t include the whole coin in the frame, just don´t think it "looks right" sort of.', '2006-06-29 13:18:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2566211, 351606, 58469, '<td valign="top">I like the colors and the minimalist execution.</td>', 'I like the colors and the minimalist execution.', '2006-06-29 13:19:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2566214, 354669, 27482, '<td valign="top">Cute title, should have taken two of those and put "II" in the title too, that would have been even funnier :)</td>', 'Cute title, should have taken two of those and put "II" in the title too, that would have been even funnier :)', '2006-06-29 13:20:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2566216, 354665, 27482, '<td valign="top">Sorry but 95% of this frame is just too dark for my taste, and yes, my screen is calibrated.  Would suggest a shadow/highlight adjustment for next time.</td>', 'Sorry but 95% of this frame is just too dark for my taste, and yes, my screen is calibrated.  Would suggest a shadow/highlight adjustment for next time.', '2006-06-29 13:21:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2566218, 354289, 58469, '<td valign="top">Sepia works well, love the POV. IMO, a larger DOF may have been helpful for the image.</td>', 'Sepia works well, love the POV. IMO, a larger DOF may have been helpful for the image.', '2006-06-29 13:22:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2566220, 353873, 58469, '<td valign="top">Entertaining and interesting image. Good job. The only thought I have that may or may not help would be to add more negative space and have an off-center image.</td>', 'Entertaining and interesting image. Good job. The only thought I have that may or may not help would be to add more negative space and have an off-center image.', '2006-06-29 13:23:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2566222, 352406, 58469, '<td valign="top">Getting near the water with your camera - either you have equipment I don''t have or you are just alot braver than I am! Focus and DOF are great. I would be interested in seeing what it would look like if there was more light on the grass creating a warmer, more colorful image.</td>', 'Getting near the water with your camera - either you have equipment I don''t have or you are just alot braver than I am! Focus and DOF are great. I would be interested in seeing what it would look like if there was more light on the grass creating a warmer, more colorful image.', '2006-06-29 13:26:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2566225, 354311, 58469, '<td valign="top">I love the angles and the exposure is perfect IMO. Well done.</td>', 'I love the angles and the exposure is perfect IMO. Well done.', '2006-06-29 13:27:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2566228, 354654, 58469, '<td valign="top">One of the most creative ideas I''ve seen in this challenge - and it was executed well. I''m not a big fan of the yellow background, but I''m not a big fan of yellow in general. Great job though!</td>', 'One of the most creative ideas I''ve seen in this challenge - and it was executed well. I''m not a big fan of the yellow background, but I''m not a big fan of yellow in general. Great job though!', '2006-06-29 13:30:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2566231, 354336, 58469, '<td valign="top">I like the concept, but the image is a litle bit too busy IMO.</td>', 'I like the concept, but the image is a litle bit too busy IMO.', '2006-06-29 13:31:23.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(2566235, 354514, 58469, '<td valign="top">I thought about trying to get an image like this but never got around to it. Well done, and props for getting up and going to find this shot.</td>', 'I thought about trying to get an image like this but never got around to it. Well done, and props for getting up and going to find this shot.', '2006-06-29 13:32:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2566240, 354638, 58469, '<td valign="top">The distortion created by the glass is interesting, but the off-kilter frame of the windo is what I''m not sure about in this image.</td>', 'The distortion created by the glass is interesting, but the off-kilter frame of the windo is what I''m not sure about in this image.', '2006-06-29 13:33:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2566241, 354623, 27482, '<td valign="top">Excellent work in regards of lighting and the tonal range in this shot, well done.  Not as fond of the composition, a bit too centered for my taste but nothing that is hurting the shot.  7 from me.</td>', 'Excellent work in regards of lighting and the tonal range in this shot, well done.  Not as fond of the composition, a bit too centered for my taste but nothing that is hurting the shot.  7 from me.', '2006-06-29 13:33:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2566244, 354339, 58469, '<td valign="top">Love the color and the dark edges of the image. Great job.</td>', 'Love the color and the dark edges of the image. Great job.', '2006-06-29 13:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2566248, 351231, 58469, '<td valign="top">The silhouette and especially the reflection in the glasses. Great job!</td>', 'The silhouette and especially the reflection in the glasses. Great job!', '2006-06-29 13:35:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2566250, 353738, 27482, '<td valign="top">Bet you are getting a few "DNMC" votes as I can imagine some people not seeing the glass for the conveyor stairs but I am not one of those, think it fits the challenge well and I hope you are doing well.  Love the composition and coloring in this!</td>', 'Bet you are getting a few "DNMC" votes as I can imagine some people not seeing the glass for the conveyor stairs but I am not one of those, think it fits the challenge well and I hope you are doing well.  Love the composition and coloring in this!', '2006-06-29 13:35:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2566254, 354708, 58469, '<td valign="top">Good job with the focus.</td>', 'Good job with the focus.', '2006-06-29 13:36:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2566256, 354751, 58469, '<td valign="top">Nice, great job with the exposure and the focus/DOF</td>', 'Nice, great job with the exposure and the focus/DOF', '2006-06-29 13:36:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2566257, 354220, 59148, '<td valign="top">Love the blue complements the brown color</td>', 'Love the blue complements the brown color', '2006-06-29 13:36:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2566258, 353518, 27482, '<td valign="top">Love the shallow DOF but I think you went just a tad overboard with it, just think this shot were stronger if the red green top were in better focus.</td>', 'Love the shallow DOF but I think you went just a tad overboard with it, just think this shot were stronger if the red green top were in better focus.', '2006-06-29 13:37:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2566261, 353934, 55169, '<td valign="top">I felt this was too dark to appreciate the subject matter.  In fact, I''m not really sure what it is.</td>', 'I felt this was too dark to appreciate the subject matter.  In fact, I''m not really sure what it is.', '2006-06-29 13:37:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2566264, 354283, 59148, '<td valign="top">Nice textures going on wonderful color love how the black surrounds and makes it pop out at you</td>', 'Nice textures going on wonderful color love how the black surrounds and makes it pop out at you', '2006-06-29 13:38:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2566265, 352295, 58469, '<td valign="top">I love the idea and the execution. I would have liked seeing a little bit more of his face and especially his eye a little bit better, but overall, great image!</td>', 'I love the idea and the execution. I would have liked seeing a little bit more of his face and especially his eye a little bit better, but overall, great image!', '2006-06-29 13:38:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2566267, 354289, 27482, '<td valign="top">Nice, but I think I would have liked it better if just the glass was in focus and he was totally out of focus or the exact other way around, "half &amp; half" like it is now isn´t really working for me.  4 from me this time but I like your thinking with this shot and I suggest you keep at this, you are on to something.</td>', 'Nice, but I think I would have liked it better if just the glass was in focus and he was totally out of focus or the exact other way around, "half & half" like it is now isn´t really working for me.  4 from me this time but I like your thinking with this shot and I suggest you keep at this, you are on to something.', '2006-06-29 13:38:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2566268, 353939, 59148, '<td valign="top">was it hard to get the fluid in the bulb? Nice composition</td>', 'was it hard to get the fluid in the bulb? Nice composition', '2006-06-29 13:39:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2566270, 351265, 58469, '<td valign="top">I love the exposure and the focus/DOF. Good job.</td>', 'I love the exposure and the focus/DOF. Good job.', '2006-06-29 13:39:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2566271, 354584, 55169, '<td valign="top">I think I would have liked this better if you had added some light to the outside of the candle holder and took advantage of the geometrics of the glass.  As it is, I think its too dark.</td>', 'I think I would have liked this better if you had added some light to the outside of the candle holder and took advantage of the geometrics of the glass.  As it is, I think its too dark.', '2006-06-29 13:39:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2566273, 354619, 59148, '<td valign="top">cropping a little strange for me.</td>', 'cropping a little strange for me.', '2006-06-29 13:39:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2566274, 352785, 27482, '<td valign="top">Just wish the sky was in tune with the blue coloring of the building, don´t want it as dark as that but definately darker than it is now.  Nice composition though, I like tha slanting.</td>', 'Just wish the sky was in tune with the blue coloring of the building, don´t want it as dark as that but definately darker than it is now.  Nice composition though, I like tha slanting.', '2006-06-29 13:40:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2566277, 354603, 59148, '<td valign="top">like the flowing line but needs more sharpness or better focus cannot really determine what your subject matter is.</td>', 'like the flowing line but needs more sharpness or better focus cannot really determine what your subject matter is.', '2006-06-29 13:40:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2566279, 354601, 59148, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and love the light dancing in the glass object</td>', 'Nice colors and love the light dancing in the glass object', '2006-06-29 13:41:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2566280, 354730, 59148, '<td valign="top">sparkle makes it work good gold sparkle tint.</td>', 'sparkle makes it work good gold sparkle tint.', '2006-06-29 13:41:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2566283, 353837, 55169, '<td valign="top">I would have rated this higher without the frame.  Unfortunately, I think it distracts from the floral centerpiece.</td>', 'I would have rated this higher without the frame.  Unfortunately, I think it distracts from the floral centerpiece.', '2006-06-29 13:42:03.000000', NULL, 1),
