(2566286, 353933, 58469, '<td valign="top">I''m having a hard time connecting to this image. The thing that gets me is probably that my eye doesn''t know where to go.</td>', 'I''m having a hard time connecting to this image. The thing that gets me is probably that my eye doesn''t know where to go.', '2006-06-29 13:42:35.000000', NULL, 1),
