(2566293, 353960, 58469, '<td valign="top">Great contrast between the warm and and cold sky. I think you did a great job, well done. The off-center composition, color, and focus are all excellent.</td>', 'Great contrast between the warm and and cold sky. I think you did a great job, well done. The off-center composition, color, and focus are all excellent.', '2006-06-29 13:44:14.000000', NULL, 1),
