(2566431, 353960, 27482, '<td valign="top">Sorry but too dark for my taste, had it not been for the title I would not have seen it was a bottle there, at first I thought "what the heck does this image have to do with glass" and then I saw the title.  Also, I did vote this image as not meeting the challenge, did you not read the description about the glass item not being intended to hold liquid for this challenge?  Shame really for I think I might have liked this image if all of it were brigher with a dramatic sky and the red hued sand.  As it is though, being too dark and not meeting the challenge, I gave out the dreaded 1 vote. :(</td>', 'Sorry but too dark for my taste, had it not been for the title I would not have seen it was a bottle there, at first I thought "what the heck does this image have to do with glass" and then I saw the title.  Also, I did vote this image as not meeting the challenge, did you not read the description about the glass item not being intended to hold liquid for this challenge?  Shame really for I think I might have liked this image if all of it were brigher with a dramatic sky and the red hued sand.  As it is though, being too dark and not meeting the challenge, I gave out the dreaded 1 vote. :(', '2006-06-29 14:27:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2566432, 353424, 58469, '<td valign="top">I''m a fan of portraits, and you have a good model for this one. My problem with the image is that while it does have glass and satisfies the rules in that respect, it''s just a portrait happens to have some glass in it. Nothing interesting was done with the glass in the image, and if anything, it detracts from the portrait by giving us great view of her armpit. Please though, let me emphasize that I DO like the image - just not the use of glass in it.</td>', 'I''m a fan of portraits, and you have a good model for this one. My problem with the image is that while it does have glass and satisfies the rules in that respect, it''s just a portrait happens to have some glass in it. Nothing interesting was done with the glass in the image, and if anything, it detracts from the portrait by giving us great view of her armpit. Please though, let me emphasize that I DO like the image - just not the use of glass in it.', '2006-06-29 14:28:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2566438, 354546, 58469, '<td valign="top">Well executed, and a great composition. The grain and the B&amp;W work well together. Nice job.</td>', 'Well executed, and a great composition. The grain and the B&W work well together. Nice job.', '2006-06-29 14:29:15.000000', NULL, 1),
