(2567233, 354619, 45475, '<td valign="top">Like the idea. You''ve almost missed the mark on the eye though. Always gotta have the <i>entire</i> eye in focus... very very important...</td>', 'Like the idea. You''ve almost missed the mark on the eye though. Always gotta have the entire eye in focus... very very important...', '2006-06-29 19:33:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2567241, 353479, 45475, '<td valign="top">What''s happened to the bg colours? Is it a filter or bad compression? The composition needs a little more room at the top and less at the bottom for good balance.</td>', 'What''s happened to the bg colours? Is it a filter or bad compression? The composition needs a little more room at the top and less at the bottom for good balance.', '2006-06-29 19:36:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2567243, 354656, 45475, '<td valign="top">Intriguing abstract. I like the colour and lighting here.</td>', 'Intriguing abstract. I like the colour and lighting here.', '2006-06-29 19:36:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2567247, 351605, 45475, '<td valign="top">Looks like artwork!</td>', 'Looks like artwork!', '2006-06-29 19:37:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2567283, 354075, 38732, '<td valign="top">Love the green colour cast and the creative setup.  Bumping up.</td>', 'Love the green colour cast and the creative setup.  Bumping up.', '2006-06-29 19:44:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2567290, 354255, 57229, '<td valign="top">Much as I hate all these glass figurines, your lighting and presentation of this is textbook...</td>', 'Much as I hate all these glass figurines, your lighting and presentation of this is textbook...', '2006-06-29 19:46:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2567317, 354633, 60223, '<td valign="top">One of the best of the lightbulb entries.  Hard to decide if I like the black bar at the top but I think I''m leaning to cropping it out.</td>', 'One of the best of the lightbulb entries.  Hard to decide if I like the black bar at the top but I think I''m leaning to cropping it out.', '2006-06-29 19:54:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2567424, 353587, 61267, '<td valign="top">I love the use of DOF to highlight the lone color marble. This photo really works for me. Great work!!!</td>', 'I love the use of DOF to highlight the lone color marble. This photo really works for me. Great work!!!', '2006-06-29 20:32:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2567434, 354631, 55199, '<td valign="top">Interesting, is that a headlight? I think this could have been enhanced by the center reflection including a car like the one this light belongs to,  or perhaps a really nice landscape.</td>', 'Interesting, is that a headlight? I think this could have been enhanced by the center reflection including a car like the one this light belongs to,  or perhaps a really nice landscape.', '2006-06-29 20:34:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2567445, 353398, 14614, '<td valign="top">Extra credit for having me remember a place I lived in as a child that had glass door knobs :)<br/> <br/>Well executed, light in the background adds the extra dimension that makes this quite artistic</td>', 'Extra credit for having me remember a place I lived in as a child that had glass door knobs :) Well executed, light in the background adds the extra dimension that makes this quite artistic', '2006-06-29 20:37:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2567452, 354734, 55199, '<td valign="top">I like the contrast and color.  Unfortunately my eyes are drawn directly to the clouds and I look right past your intended subject.</td>', 'I like the contrast and color.  Unfortunately my eyes are drawn directly to the clouds and I look right past your intended subject.', '2006-06-29 20:40:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2567465, 354638, 55199, '<td valign="top">I like your glass and the visual effect it has on the flowers.  I''m not sure I like the composition, but I don''t know how to tell you what you might have done different.  Maybe zoom out a little and add more width?</td>', 'I like your glass and the visual effect it has on the flowers.  I''m not sure I like the composition, but I don''t know how to tell you what you might have done different.  Maybe zoom out a little and add more width?', '2006-06-29 20:46:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2567481, 351265, 55199, '<td valign="top">The composition is pretty good and I like your idea.  I think the DOF may be a wee bit too shallow because the prong on the top left looks the most in focus and the glass looks a bit out of focus.  It would be nicer if your glass had a little better focus.  Also the lighting seems little bit harsh.</td>', 'The composition is pretty good and I like your idea.  I think the DOF may be a wee bit too shallow because the prong on the top left looks the most in focus and the glass looks a bit out of focus.  It would be nicer if your glass had a little better focus.  Also the lighting seems little bit harsh.', '2006-06-29 20:52:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2567502, 353250, 55199, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.  The lower third of this photo doesn''t add anything to the mirror, nor to your title.  It might be better to crop off the bottom near the front edge of the dresser.</td>', 'Nice idea.  The lower third of this photo doesn''t add anything to the mirror, nor to your title.  It might be better to crop off the bottom near the front edge of the dresser.', '2006-06-29 21:05:20.000000', NULL, 1),
