(2567523, 354746, 36382, '<td valign="top">It''s nice to see a photograph with a person in it.  This is beautiful.  The black and white and the grain suit it IMO.</td>', 'It''s nice to see a photograph with a person in it.  This is beautiful.  The black and white and the grain suit it IMO.', '2006-06-29 21:16:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2567530, 353273, 51538, '<td valign="top">I''ve been by this image several times and tried to think of something to say.  Nothing came to mind but something is missing so I played with it in PS and found that if you boost the saturation, it becomes a little more lively.  Flip the image 45 degrees and crop it fairly tightly, and you get rid of the dilution factor.  Then play with either levels or with hue/sat and see what happens.  It has potential. 6.</td>', 'I''ve been by this image several times and tried to think of something to say.  Nothing came to mind but something is missing so I played with it in PS and found that if you boost the saturation, it becomes a little more lively.  Flip the image 45 degrees and crop it fairly tightly, and you get rid of the dilution factor.  Then play with either levels or with hue/sat and see what happens.  It has potential. 6.', '2006-06-29 21:20:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2567531, 352255, 4793, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors</td>', 'Beautiful colors', '2006-06-29 21:21:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2567536, 353456, 51538, '<td valign="top">Quite a symbolic image.  It has a duality to it: light/dark, hot/cool, negative/positive.  The image is really quite simple with high contrast in content.  Not sure how it might compete against images with richer content, but it does the job and stands alone.  Sometimes putting images like this into competition seems to reduce their worth somehow...</td>', 'Quite a symbolic image.  It has a duality to it: light/dark, hot/cool, negative/positive.  The image is really quite simple with high contrast in content.  Not sure how it might compete against images with richer content, but it does the job and stands alone.  Sometimes putting images like this into competition seems to reduce their worth somehow...', '2006-06-29 21:22:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2567537, 354408, 51538, '<td valign="top">Bizarre garden ornament.  I imagine in the right lighting it might be quite beautiful.</td>', 'Bizarre garden ornament.  I imagine in the right lighting it might be quite beautiful.', '2006-06-29 21:23:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2567541, 354119, 51538, '<td valign="top">A nice idea and the tones are good.  I wonder what other poses might have worked.  I find this stretchy profile looks a little tense and unnatural.</td>', 'A nice idea and the tones are good.  I wonder what other poses might have worked.  I find this stretchy profile looks a little tense and unnatural.', '2006-06-29 21:24:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2567542, 353786, 51538, '<td valign="top">Good idea.  Might have tried placing the necklace on a mirror or coloured card or.... just to give it a focal boost.</td>', 'Good idea.  Might have tried placing the necklace on a mirror or coloured card or.... just to give it a focal boost.', '2006-06-29 21:25:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2567548, 354341, 51538, '<td valign="top">I am hazarding a guess that a better way of photographing this paperweight would be to place it on a piece of black card or cloth, over a small hole, through which a fairly strong light is shone.  The light would bounce around the pw and illuminate it very nicely.  Background black of course.  Even have a child''s face peering at it close up with the light from the pw illuminating the face.</td>', 'I am hazarding a guess that a better way of photographing this paperweight would be to place it on a piece of black card or cloth, over a small hole, through which a fairly strong light is shone.  The light would bounce around the pw and illuminate it very nicely.  Background black of course.  Even have a child''s face peering at it close up with the light from the pw illuminating the face.', '2006-06-29 21:27:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2567551, 352254, 51538, '<td valign="top">When CDs first landed on this planet of monkeys, they seemed like jewels, something rare, power-giving, and mystical.  These days they are something different - merely plastic.  The CDs in this case do not showcase the glass and the spectral reflections of the CDs is a little washed out.  Perhaps photographing the bulb on a dark base with CDs hanging from thin threads in the background to give bokeh etc would have made the bulb pop a little. (So to speak ;-)</td>', 'When CDs first landed on this planet of monkeys, they seemed like jewels, something rare, power-giving, and mystical.  These days they are something different - merely plastic.  The CDs in this case do not showcase the glass and the spectral reflections of the CDs is a little washed out.  Perhaps photographing the bulb on a dark base with CDs hanging from thin threads in the background to give bokeh etc would have made the bulb pop a little. (So to speak ;-)', '2006-06-29 21:30:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2567567, 354650, 55199, '<td valign="top">This must have been a challenging shot to get.  I think the composition would be stronger if you cropped the top just under the second bright spot on the left most edge.  Nice job.</td>', 'This must have been a challenging shot to get.  I think the composition would be stronger if you cropped the top just under the second bright spot on the left most edge.  Nice job.', '2006-06-29 21:34:09.000000', NULL, 1),
