(2569365, 352697, 56797, '<td valign="top">I usually dig reflections. this ones not working for me. i loved the top half of the photo as it was opening and then when the bottom popped up I lost interest. The reflections very nicely done. It just seems to detract from the crisp clean modern feel the top half alone had.8</td>', 'I usually dig reflections. this ones not working for me. i loved the top half of the photo as it was opening and then when the bottom popped up I lost interest. The reflections very nicely done. It just seems to detract from the crisp clean modern feel the top half alone had.8', '2006-06-30 12:08:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2569369, 351231, 56797, '<td valign="top">interesting. I dont personally care for the white dots on or through the window. im not sure wahts those are. stars? is that a night shot? everything else about this is cool though.</td>', 'interesting. I dont personally care for the white dots on or through the window. im not sure wahts those are. stars? is that a night shot? everything else about this is cool though.', '2006-06-30 12:09:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2569371, 353158, 43774, '<td valign="top">This is lovely. It''s sort of what I wanted to do but I couldn''t get it to work out right. Beautiful colours.</td>', 'This is lovely. It''s sort of what I wanted to do but I couldn''t get it to work out right. Beautiful colours.', '2006-06-30 12:09:24.000000', NULL, 1),
