(2572558, 354640, 37893, '<td valign="top">Ok this is a ribbon! Great job. Seems like the water level in the aquarium wasn`t level enough :) But what a clear crisp image!</td>', 'Ok this is a ribbon! Great job. Seems like the water level in the aquarium wasn`t level enough :) But what a clear crisp image!', '2006-07-01 16:37:54.000000', NULL, 1),
