(2572570, 354753, 30982, '<td valign="top">Colorful and meets the challenge but it''s a bit too stylized for my taste.</td>', 'Colorful and meets the challenge but it''s a bit too stylized for my taste.', '2006-07-01 16:47:18.000000', NULL, 1),
