(2572938, 354283, 40679, '<td valign="top">what is this what I''m looking at? a big marble? interesting textures inside the ball.</td>', 'what is this what I''m looking at? a big marble? interesting textures inside the ball.', '2006-07-01 19:14:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2572954, 354294, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very nice, rich color to this shot.  Good job at keeping the reflections to a minimum, too.</td>', 'Very nice, rich color to this shot.  Good job at keeping the reflections to a minimum, too.', '2006-07-01 19:20:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2572955, 354721, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nice macro!  Almost other worldly in a way.</td>', 'Nice macro!  Almost other worldly in a way.', '2006-07-01 19:21:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2572957, 353750, 30982, '<td valign="top">Technicals are good as far as exposure and color, but subject seems almost too close to really get an idea of what''s being portrayed.  Storm?  Or was just some glass broken and placed here?</td>', 'Technicals are good as far as exposure and color, but subject seems almost too close to really get an idea of what''s being portrayed.  Storm?  Or was just some glass broken and placed here?', '2006-07-01 19:22:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2572958, 353977, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nice low key work here.</td>', 'Nice low key work here.', '2006-07-01 19:23:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2572959, 353590, 30982, '<td valign="top">Pretty piece of glass.  Shadow in the back doesn''t seem related, but does provide a bit of balance.</td>', 'Pretty piece of glass.  Shadow in the back doesn''t seem related, but does provide a bit of balance.', '2006-07-01 19:24:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2572960, 354707, 30982, '<td valign="top">Interesting setting for the object!</td>', 'Interesting setting for the object!', '2006-07-01 19:24:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2572963, 354278, 30982, '<td valign="top">This seems like there''s too much going on and no central point on which to focus.  Not entirely sure what the glass object is, which is OK for a macro or an abstract, but here I seem to want to know what it is.</td>', 'This seems like there''s too much going on and no central point on which to focus.  Not entirely sure what the glass object is, which is OK for a macro or an abstract, but here I seem to want to know what it is.', '2006-07-01 19:26:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2572964, 354489, 30982, '<td valign="top">The exposure is dead on to me, and I like the violet hues in the crystal.  Not fond of the internal single line border - it''s not needed here - picture can stand alone without it.</td>', 'The exposure is dead on to me, and I like the violet hues in the crystal.  Not fond of the internal single line border - it''s not needed here - picture can stand alone without it.', '2006-07-01 19:27:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2572967, 353479, 30982, '<td valign="top">A little blown/oversaturated on the left but does give the impression of going from "stormy" to "calm".</td>', 'A little blown/oversaturated on the left but does give the impression of going from "stormy" to "calm".', '2006-07-01 19:28:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2572969, 351305, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nice view of a jar of marbles.  The red one in the upper right looks like a one-eyed guy with an evil grin.</td>', 'Nice view of a jar of marbles.  The red one in the upper right looks like a one-eyed guy with an evil grin.', '2006-07-01 19:29:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2572970, 354773, 30982, '<td valign="top">While the picture has glass in it, glass doesn''t appear to be the primary focus or intent.  Interesting poster, though.</td>', 'While the picture has glass in it, glass doesn''t appear to be the primary focus or intent.  Interesting poster, though.', '2006-07-01 19:30:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2572972, 353974, 30982, '<td valign="top">Good basic composition - would probably work well for a stock photo except for the date.  Those things are addicting.</td>', 'Good basic composition - would probably work well for a stock photo except for the date.  Those things are addicting.', '2006-07-01 19:31:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2572974, 354295, 30982, '<td valign="top">Good studio type shot of glass objects.  Colors are nice, you kept detail in the clear edges, nothing seems blown.</td>', 'Good studio type shot of glass objects.  Colors are nice, you kept detail in the clear edges, nothing seems blown.', '2006-07-01 19:31:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2572975, 354666, 30982, '<td valign="top">Good "beach" ad-type photo with the bright colors in the background.  Could crop just a bit off the bottom.</td>', 'Good "beach" ad-type photo with the bright colors in the background.  Could crop just a bit off the bottom.', '2006-07-01 19:32:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2572976, 354102, 30982, '<td valign="top">In this case, I like the blown bits, especially how it makes the flower seem almost on fire.</td>', 'In this case, I like the blown bits, especially how it makes the flower seem almost on fire.', '2006-07-01 19:33:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2572979, 354560, 30982, '<td valign="top">Simple and balanced.  Would almost like to see one very different colored ball somewhere in the line.</td>', 'Simple and balanced.  Would almost like to see one very different colored ball somewhere in the line.', '2006-07-01 19:33:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2572980, 354339, 30982, '<td valign="top">Well done capture of stained glass.</td>', 'Well done capture of stained glass.', '2006-07-01 19:34:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2572983, 354124, 30982, '<td valign="top">Different approach to the subject!  I like that you cut her head off but am not sure about the arms straight out and cut off.  Overall the picture seems very soft.</td>', 'Different approach to the subject!  I like that you cut her head off but am not sure about the arms straight out and cut off.  Overall the picture seems very soft.', '2006-07-01 19:35:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2572987, 352830, 30982, '<td valign="top">Took me a minute to figure that they''re sitting on a mirror outside.  A bit of color noise and the blue sky seems a tad on the grayish side.  Figurines on the left side kind of run together - hard to see what they are.</td>', 'Took me a minute to figure that they''re sitting on a mirror outside.  A bit of color noise and the blue sky seems a tad on the grayish side.  Figurines on the left side kind of run together - hard to see what they are.', '2006-07-01 19:36:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2572991, 354506, 30982, '<td valign="top">Love the color palette in this one - nicely seen, good composition.  Beyond the basic rules editing, it needs a wee bit of perspective tweak.  Very nice shot.</td>', 'Love the color palette in this one - nicely seen, good composition.  Beyond the basic rules editing, it needs a wee bit of perspective tweak.  Very nice shot.', '2006-07-01 19:37:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2572993, 354532, 30982, '<td valign="top">The bright green of the leaves tends to pull the eye.  Overall color saturation in the reflection is very nice.</td>', 'The bright green of the leaves tends to pull the eye.  Overall color saturation in the reflection is very nice.', '2006-07-01 19:38:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2572994, 354346, 30982, '<td valign="top">A shot that might appear in a catalog for objects like this.  The dark part looks almost like a shadow has fallen over it.</td>', 'A shot that might appear in a catalog for objects like this.  The dark part looks almost like a shadow has fallen over it.', '2006-07-01 19:39:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2572997, 354157, 30982, '<td valign="top">The reds/yellows/greens in the reflection are very nice!  Not sure about the sparks or whatever flying about.</td>', 'The reds/yellows/greens in the reflection are very nice!  Not sure about the sparks or whatever flying about.', '2006-07-01 19:39:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2572998, 354339, 4793, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors</td>', 'Beautiful colors', '2006-07-01 19:40:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2573000, 354358, 4793, '<td valign="top">Beautiful composition, nice b&amp;w tones</td>', 'Beautiful composition, nice b&w tones', '2006-07-01 19:40:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2573001, 354730, 30982, '<td valign="top">Sparklies are nice!  Sky is very muted and grayish rather than blue.</td>', 'Sparklies are nice!  Sky is very muted and grayish rather than blue.', '2006-07-01 19:40:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2573004, 354663, 4793, '<td valign="top">Nice colors</td>', 'Nice colors', '2006-07-01 19:41:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2573006, 352795, 4793, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors</td>', 'Beautiful colors', '2006-07-01 19:41:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2573009, 354393, 4793, '<td valign="top">Nice colors</td>', 'Nice colors', '2006-07-01 19:42:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2573011, 352870, 4793, '<td valign="top">Nice tones</td>', 'Nice tones', '2006-07-01 19:42:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2573014, 353570, 30982, '<td valign="top">Basic composition is good with the diagonal from the little fish up to the big one.  I think this might have been more effective with a black or much darker background.  The mauvish textured cloth kinda detracts for me.</td>', 'Basic composition is good with the diagonal from the little fish up to the big one.  I think this might have been more effective with a black or much darker background.  The mauvish textured cloth kinda detracts for me.', '2006-07-01 19:42:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2573016, 354505, 4793, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and shapes</td>', 'Nice colors and shapes', '2006-07-01 19:42:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2573019, 353518, 4793, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors</td>', 'Beautiful colors', '2006-07-01 19:43:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2573020, 354693, 4793, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors</td>', 'Beautiful colors', '2006-07-01 19:43:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2573079, 353044, 49897, '<td valign="top">AWESOME!!!</td>', 'AWESOME!!!', '2006-07-01 20:12:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2573104, 354630, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nice touch highlighting the word.  Would probably make a good stock photo, but keep in mnd I know nothing about stock photography.</td>', 'Nice touch highlighting the word.  Would probably make a good stock photo, but keep in mnd I know nothing about stock photography.', '2006-07-01 20:19:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2573108, 354255, 30982, '<td valign="top">The blue works well, but it''s too fuzzy for my taste.  Very lovely piece of glass.</td>', 'The blue works well, but it''s too fuzzy for my taste.  Very lovely piece of glass.', '2006-07-01 20:19:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2573112, 354691, 30982, '<td valign="top">Angle of the shot is nice - creates a nice play of pattern across whatever the object is.</td>', 'Angle of the shot is nice - creates a nice play of pattern across whatever the object is.', '2006-07-01 20:20:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2573114, 354669, 30982, '<td valign="top">The jagged edge is quite abrupt in the otherwise soft, delicate setting.  Nice take on the challenge.</td>', 'The jagged edge is quite abrupt in the otherwise soft, delicate setting.  Nice take on the challenge.', '2006-07-01 20:21:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2573125, 354291, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very colorful indeed!  I''m amazed you could get a picture with this much color info to 150K.</td>', 'Very colorful indeed!  I''m amazed you could get a picture with this much color info to 150K.', '2006-07-01 20:23:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2573132, 353433, 30982, '<td valign="top">Hard thing to expose correctly without losing detail or blowing highlights.  The white side looks just a bit bluish gray in the background.  It does make for an interesting abstract.</td>', 'Hard thing to expose correctly without losing detail or blowing highlights.  The white side looks just a bit bluish gray in the background.  It does make for an interesting abstract.', '2006-07-01 20:25:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2573133, 353968, 30982, '<td valign="top">Kinda too bad you cut off the sphere - it looks incomplete to me.</td>', 'Kinda too bad you cut off the sphere - it looks incomplete to me.', '2006-07-01 20:26:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2573135, 352295, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nicely done - for me, there''s just enough light on the model.</td>', 'Nicely done - for me, there''s just enough light on the model.', '2006-07-01 20:26:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2573138, 354365, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting, good lines, crisp.  Very aesthetically pleasing to me.</td>', 'Nice lighting, good lines, crisp.  Very aesthetically pleasing to me.', '2006-07-01 20:27:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2573139, 354583, 30982, '<td valign="top">Lighting is good for a glass object.  The sea seems to fall off at the edges, though.  :-)</td>', 'Lighting is good for a glass object.  The sea seems to fall off at the edges, though.  :-)', '2006-07-01 20:28:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2573141, 354126, 30982, '<td valign="top">The simple composition is nice.  A bit flat in color/contrast.</td>', 'The simple composition is nice.  A bit flat in color/contrast.', '2006-07-01 20:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2573143, 353800, 30982, '<td valign="top">The eye is drawn more toward the deck chairs and tables in the background.  I suspect it''s because of the lighting.  I do like the compostion - your model looks rather disappointed.</td>', 'The eye is drawn more toward the deck chairs and tables in the background.  I suspect it''s because of the lighting.  I do like the compostion - your model looks rather disappointed.', '2006-07-01 20:30:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2573146, 354537, 30982, '<td valign="top">In my opinion, this might be even more striking exposed just a bit less and with the swan just a hair more to the right.</td>', 'In my opinion, this might be even more striking exposed just a bit less and with the swan just a hair more to the right.', '2006-07-01 20:31:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2573147, 351657, 30982, '<td valign="top">Colorful, striking abstract.  I will trust that this is indeed glass.</td>', 'Colorful, striking abstract.  I will trust that this is indeed glass.', '2006-07-01 20:32:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2573151, 353483, 30982, '<td valign="top">This is a rather pleasing still life composition.  Just needs a bit whiter white, maybe.  I like the vase and flowers just out of focus.</td>', 'This is a rather pleasing still life composition.  Just needs a bit whiter white, maybe.  I like the vase and flowers just out of focus.', '2006-07-01 20:33:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2573153, 354574, 30982, '<td valign="top">Well seen and captures.</td>', 'Well seen and captures.', '2006-07-01 20:33:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2573155, 354725, 30982, '<td valign="top">Not exactly sure what to make of it, but I like it.</td>', 'Not exactly sure what to make of it, but I like it.', '2006-07-01 20:35:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2573156, 354405, 30982, '<td valign="top">I like how the crop on the right creates a sense of a floating box.</td>', 'I like how the crop on the right creates a sense of a floating box.', '2006-07-01 20:35:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2573157, 353760, 30982, '<td valign="top">I do like the composition and lighting of this.  I wish it were a bit bigger!  You''re allowed 640 pixels on the longest side - be sure to use all the space you can.</td>', 'I do like the composition and lighting of this.  I wish it were a bit bigger!  You''re allowed 640 pixels on the longest side - be sure to use all the space you can.', '2006-07-01 20:36:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2573158, 351327, 30982, '<td valign="top">Clever and well done.</td>', 'Clever and well done.', '2006-07-01 20:36:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2573159, 354698, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very well done!!</td>', 'Very well done!!', '2006-07-01 20:37:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2573160, 354549, 30982, '<td valign="top">Lovely bold abstract - very nice.</td>', 'Lovely bold abstract - very nice.', '2006-07-01 20:37:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2573162, 353837, 30982, '<td valign="top">Wow - there''s a little guy with a red hat and a moustache right about the middle of the picture.  This is very nice!</td>', 'Wow - there''s a little guy with a red hat and a moustache right about the middle of the picture.  This is very nice!', '2006-07-01 20:38:17.000000', NULL, 1),
