(2573462, 351326, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nice low key approach; simple composition.  Like the barely perceptible background light/texture.</td>', 'Nice low key approach; simple composition.  Like the barely perceptible background light/texture.', '2006-07-01 23:01:01.000000', NULL, 1),
