(2575163, 354514, 35274, '<td valign="top">well, that''s glass alright! i really love seeing glass being blown, i think it''s such an interesting sight. Good luck!</td>', 'well, that''s glass alright! i really love seeing glass being blown, i think it''s such an interesting sight. Good luck!', '2006-07-02 17:43:32.000000', NULL, 1),
