(2576106, 354640, 60165, '<td valign="top">Wow!</td>', 'Wow!', '2006-07-03 00:15:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2576120, 354291, 61413, '<td valign="top">There is some fascinating stuff going on inside the glass, here. But I find the busy periphery too distracting.<br/> <br/>If this was an advanced editing challenge, I''d suggest blurring and desaturating the background. For a basic editing challenge like this, though, you''re going to have to think of another way of composing the shot; getting the colour inside the glass with creating too distracting a background.</td>', 'There is some fascinating stuff going on inside the glass, here. But I find the busy periphery too distracting. If this was an advanced editing challenge, I''d suggest blurring and desaturating the background. For a basic editing challenge like this, though, you''re going to have to think of another way of composing the shot; getting the colour inside the glass with creating too distracting a background.', '2006-07-03 00:19:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2576126, 353939, 38732, '<td valign="top">Creative image.  I like the green colour and the tight crop of this shot.  Bumping up!</td>', 'Creative image.  I like the green colour and the tight crop of this shot.  Bumping up!', '2006-07-03 00:19:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2576133, 352784, 61413, '<td valign="top">A nice simple idea, well executed. There is sufficient detail in the shadow (particularly the reflection) to make the picture complete.</td>', 'A nice simple idea, well executed. There is sufficient detail in the shadow (particularly the reflection) to make the picture complete.', '2006-07-03 00:21:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2576151, 352714, 61413, '<td valign="top">Nice juxtaposition. Plenty of detail in the reflections and refractions of the salt shaker - the essence of a good glass photo.<br/> <br/>I can''t fault it; but I''d call it competent, rather than inspired - which is about as good as I ever aspire too...  :-)</td>', 'Nice juxtaposition. Plenty of detail in the reflections and refractions of the salt shaker - the essence of a good glass photo. I can''t fault it; but I''d call it competent, rather than inspired - which is about as good as I ever aspire too...  :-)', '2006-07-03 00:24:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2576173, 354708, 61413, '<td valign="top">A great idea, well executed. And with a title that enhances your perception of the photo, too.<br/> <br/>I love the way the text recedes away from the focal point, a la "Star Wars".<br/> <br/>Well done.</td>', 'A great idea, well executed. And with a title that enhances your perception of the photo, too. I love the way the text recedes away from the focal point, a la "Star Wars". Well done.', '2006-07-03 00:33:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2576175, 352785, 61413, '<td valign="top">This is a stunner.<br/> <br/>I love the idea of making the crane the horizontal element - inspired. And the range of blues in the windows and the sky is great.</td>', 'This is a stunner. I love the idea of making the crane the horizontal element - inspired. And the range of blues in the windows and the sky is great.', '2006-07-03 00:36:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2576184, 353800, 61413, '<td valign="top">This captures the mood of the subject well.<br/> <br/>It''s a shame there isn''t more light on the girl''s face, creating a bit more contrast. But then, it is a rainy day, I suppose...</td>', 'This captures the mood of the subject well. It''s a shame there isn''t more light on the girl''s face, creating a bit more contrast. But then, it is a rainy day, I suppose...', '2006-07-03 00:40:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2576190, 354312, 38732, '<td valign="top">Really like the duotone.  Bumping up!</td>', 'Really like the duotone.  Bumping up!', '2006-07-03 00:42:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2576191, 354751, 38732, '<td valign="top">Definately points for creativity, though I''m not sure how I feel about the lighting.  I''ll have to come back to this one later.</td>', 'Definately points for creativity, though I''m not sure how I feel about the lighting.  I''ll have to come back to this one later.', '2006-07-03 00:42:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2576193, 354362, 38732, '<td valign="top">Awesome DOF.  I like how the entire shot only focuses on the magnifying glass.</td>', 'Awesome DOF.  I like how the entire shot only focuses on the magnifying glass.', '2006-07-03 00:43:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2576197, 352998, 38732, '<td valign="top">Like the composition of this shot and the play on words with the title :)  Bumping Up!</td>', 'Like the composition of this shot and the play on words with the title :)  Bumping Up!', '2006-07-03 00:43:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2576198, 354067, 38732, '<td valign="top">Creative idea.  I''m guessing this was painted with light, but I could be wrong.  Would like to know it was done when the challenge is over.  Bumping up!</td>', 'Creative idea.  I''m guessing this was painted with light, but I could be wrong.  Would like to know it was done when the challenge is over.  Bumping up!', '2006-07-03 00:43:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2576199, 354489, 38732, '<td valign="top">Unusual combination of subjects makes this an interesting shot for me.  Not sure I like the border though.  Have to come back for another look later to decide.</td>', 'Unusual combination of subjects makes this an interesting shot for me.  Not sure I like the border though.  Have to come back for another look later to decide.', '2006-07-03 00:43:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2576200, 352859, 38732, '<td valign="top">Great use of complimentary colours.  I love how some of the water drops are both blue and orange.</td>', 'Great use of complimentary colours.  I love how some of the water drops are both blue and orange.', '2006-07-03 00:43:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2576201, 353587, 38732, '<td valign="top">Like the pattern effect and the DOF.  Bumping up!</td>', 'Like the pattern effect and the DOF.  Bumping up!', '2006-07-03 00:43:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2576202, 354404, 38732, '<td valign="top">Like the bright colours against the blue sky.  I also like how the marbles are sharply captured.  Bumping up!</td>', 'Like the bright colours against the blue sky.  I also like how the marbles are sharply captured.  Bumping up!', '2006-07-03 00:43:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2576203, 353977, 38732, '<td valign="top">I like the simplicity along with the black background to focus on the subject.</td>', 'I like the simplicity along with the black background to focus on the subject.', '2006-07-03 00:43:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2576204, 353250, 38732, '<td valign="top">To me this tells a story, with the mirror the main point of interest.  The title if very fitting.  I also like the black and white.  Bumping up!</td>', 'To me this tells a story, with the mirror the main point of interest.  The title if very fitting.  I also like the black and white.  Bumping up!', '2006-07-03 00:43:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2576205, 354358, 38732, '<td valign="top">I think the black and white does it for me in this shot.  Fitting title as well.</td>', 'I think the black and white does it for me in this shot.  Fitting title as well.', '2006-07-03 00:44:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2576209, 352785, 59877, '<td valign="top">pretty cool neat angle</td>', 'pretty cool neat angle', '2006-07-03 00:45:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2576210, 354675, 38732, '<td valign="top">Creative idea.  Fitting title.</td>', 'Creative idea.  Fitting title.', '2006-07-03 00:45:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2576211, 354220, 59877, '<td valign="top">awsome i like trhe colors</td>', 'awsome i like trhe colors', '2006-07-03 00:45:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2576212, 352289, 38732, '<td valign="top">Love the colour.  A very happy shot :)</td>', 'Love the colour.  A very happy shot :)', '2006-07-03 00:45:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2576213, 353837, 38732, '<td valign="top">Love how the texture of the window plays with the flowers behind it.  I also like how you included the window frame making this shot look like a nice abstract painting.</td>', 'Love how the texture of the window plays with the flowers behind it.  I also like how you included the window frame making this shot look like a nice abstract painting.', '2006-07-03 00:45:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2576215, 354022, 38732, '<td valign="top">The shot isn''t terribly creative or exciting, but definite points for composition.  Simple, crisp image.</td>', 'The shot isn''t terribly creative or exciting, but definite points for composition.  Simple, crisp image.', '2006-07-03 00:45:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2576216, 354267, 38732, '<td valign="top">Love the perspective and the use of leading lines to project me through this shot.</td>', 'Love the perspective and the use of leading lines to project me through this shot.', '2006-07-03 00:45:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2576217, 353396, 38732, '<td valign="top">Like the complimentary colours and the angle of this shot.  Bumping up!</td>', 'Like the complimentary colours and the angle of this shot.  Bumping up!', '2006-07-03 00:46:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2576219, 353584, 38732, '<td valign="top">Like the shapes and DOF.  Maybe cleaning the window a little would have removed most of the dust/dirt and made for a cleaner shot.</td>', 'Like the shapes and DOF.  Maybe cleaning the window a little would have removed most of the dust/dirt and made for a cleaner shot.', '2006-07-03 00:46:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2576220, 354007, 38732, '<td valign="top">Like the DOF and the colours.</td>', 'Like the DOF and the colours.', '2006-07-03 00:46:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2576223, 354289, 61413, '<td valign="top">A great idea. Nicely composed too, although the subject looks just a little cross-eyed. Probably because he''s looking at the crack in the mirror rather than at (or, even better, behind) the camera''s reflection.<br/> <br/>Effective lighting on the face, too.<br/> <br/>Did you think about asking your subject to hold off shaving for the shot? It might''ve enhanced the broody effect. And men usually see a bit of stubble when they look at themselves in the mirror in the morning...</td>', 'A great idea. Nicely composed too, although the subject looks just a little cross-eyed. Probably because he''s looking at the crack in the mirror rather than at (or, even better, behind) the camera''s reflection. Effective lighting on the face, too. Did you think about asking your subject to hold off shaving for the shot? It might''ve enhanced the broody effect. And men usually see a bit of stubble when they look at themselves in the mirror in the morning...', '2006-07-03 00:47:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2576224, 354546, 38732, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.  The dirty windows add a lot to this shot for me.</td>', 'Nice composition.  The dirty windows add a lot to this shot for me.', '2006-07-03 00:47:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2576225, 354331, 40484, '<td valign="top">Cute idea. Perhaps a softer lighting and a darker colour background would make the glass more appealing The flat light does not do anything to enhance the shot.</td>', 'Cute idea. Perhaps a softer lighting and a darker colour background would make the glass more appealing The flat light does not do anything to enhance the shot.', '2006-07-03 00:47:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2576227, 354225, 38732, '<td valign="top">Love the angle and tight crop.  I think this would be a pretty good stock photo.  Bumping up!</td>', 'Love the angle and tight crop.  I think this would be a pretty good stock photo.  Bumping up!', '2006-07-03 00:47:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2576228, 354689, 38732, '<td valign="top">Lots of character in this shot.</td>', 'Lots of character in this shot.', '2006-07-03 00:48:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2576229, 354640, 38732, '<td valign="top">Interesting concept and I like the blue cast.</td>', 'Interesting concept and I like the blue cast.', '2006-07-03 00:48:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2576230, 354634, 38732, '<td valign="top">I like the red and blue against the black background.  Creative shot!</td>', 'I like the red and blue against the black background.  Creative shot!', '2006-07-03 00:48:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2576231, 354514, 59877, '<td valign="top">i did one just like this.. i think yours is better its really cool</td>', 'i did one just like this.. i think yours is better its really cool', '2006-07-03 00:48:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2576232, 352821, 38732, '<td valign="top">Like the pattern and colours reflected in the windows.</td>', 'Like the pattern and colours reflected in the windows.', '2006-07-03 00:48:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2576238, 354720, 38732, '<td valign="top">Good composition and a very fitting title.</td>', 'Good composition and a very fitting title.', '2006-07-03 00:49:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2576239, 354699, 38732, '<td valign="top">Great composition.  Love the DOF and leading line through the shot.  Also like the blue colour of the stones and background.</td>', 'Great composition.  Love the DOF and leading line through the shot.  Also like the blue colour of the stones and background.', '2006-07-03 00:49:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2576240, 354331, 38732, '<td valign="top">Hey, I think that''s holding liquid :)<br/> <br/>Very creative idea.</td>', 'Hey, I think that''s holding liquid :) Very creative idea.', '2006-07-03 00:49:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2576241, 354119, 38732, '<td valign="top">I love the texture created by the glass and the lighting seems to hit the subject just right.  Looks like a painting to me :)</td>', 'I love the texture created by the glass and the lighting seems to hit the subject just right.  Looks like a painting to me :)', '2006-07-03 00:49:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2576244, 353398, 61413, '<td valign="top">This is nicely composed, with the main visual elements positioned well. A good level of detail, too. But I do find the burned out white spot in the background a bit distracting.<br/> <br/>I''ll take your word for it that the door knob is glass. But there''s not a lot of "glassy" things happening, in terms of interesting reflection, refraction, etc.</td>', 'This is nicely composed, with the main visual elements positioned well. A good level of detail, too. But I do find the burned out white spot in the background a bit distracting. I''ll take your word for it that the door knob is glass. But there''s not a lot of "glassy" things happening, in terms of interesting reflection, refraction, etc.', '2006-07-03 00:50:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2576245, 354324, 40484, '<td valign="top">Good message. If your intent was to depict an arm after an accident, I would think it would be more effective to have the hand in a more relaxed position to give a feeling of unconsciousness and no muscle control.</td>', 'Good message. If your intent was to depict an arm after an accident, I would think it would be more effective to have the hand in a more relaxed position to give a feeling of unconsciousness and no muscle control.', '2006-07-03 00:50:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2576249, 353479, 40484, '<td valign="top">I like the idea you are going for. The glass ship is getting overwhelmed by the strength of the background and so it loses effectiveness.</td>', 'I like the idea you are going for. The glass ship is getting overwhelmed by the strength of the background and so it loses effectiveness.', '2006-07-03 00:53:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2576256, 354535, 40484, '<td valign="top">The lightbulb is very hard to pick out in the shot. Perhaps you could try moving in closer to the subject and not have so much foreground showing.</td>', 'The lightbulb is very hard to pick out in the shot. Perhaps you could try moving in closer to the subject and not have so much foreground showing.', '2006-07-03 00:55:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2576258, 354358, 61413, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot. Complex without being busy. All the angles, reflections, etc, work well together.<br/> <br/>It does kinda bug me that it''s not <i>quite</i> vertical. I think it would''ve worked well as a properly vertical shot, or as an abviously angled one. But this "almost but not quite" thing just makes it look like a framing error.<br/> <br/>I think making it monochrome was the right choice; too many colours would have pushed it over into being "busy". But it might also work well as a duotone or tritone.</td>', 'This is a great shot. Complex without being busy. All the angles, reflections, etc, work well together. It does kinda bug me that it''s not quite vertical. I think it would''ve worked well as a properly vertical shot, or as an abviously angled one. But this "almost but not quite" thing just makes it look like a framing error. I think making it monochrome was the right choice; too many colours would have pushed it over into being "busy". But it might also work well as a duotone or tritone.', '2006-07-03 00:55:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2576261, 354720, 42495, '<td valign="top">Good picture; good message.  DOF works great here.</td>', 'Good picture; good message.  DOF works great here.', '2006-07-03 00:57:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2576271, 354362, 61413, '<td valign="top">A great idea. Unfortunately, the background is so out of focus that I don''t get a real sense of there being a newspaper there for the magnifying glass to focus on. Maybe it needs just a little more depth of field. This would bring out more detail of the glass itself, as well, which would add to the shot.</td>', 'A great idea. Unfortunately, the background is so out of focus that I don''t get a real sense of there being a newspaper there for the magnifying glass to focus on. Maybe it needs just a little more depth of field. This would bring out more detail of the glass itself, as well, which would add to the shot.', '2006-07-03 00:59:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2576594, 354691, 61413, '<td valign="top">This is a nice idea for a shot. The reflections and refractions running diagonally across the lenses are quite absorbing.<br/> <br/>It''s a shame about the flecks of light everywhere. I assume that this is the internal lighting, but it creates the impresison of a damaged or dirty subject. Would it have been practical to turn off these lights?</td>', 'This is a nice idea for a shot. The reflections and refractions running diagonally across the lenses are quite absorbing. It''s a shame about the flecks of light everywhere. I assume that this is the internal lighting, but it creates the impresison of a damaged or dirty subject. Would it have been practical to turn off these lights?', '2006-07-03 01:46:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2576632, 353288, 61413, '<td valign="top">As a photo of rope, this works well. Good detail and nicely framed.<br/> <br/>But the "glass" element is a bit lacking, unfortunately. If it had been a cleaner, more transparent sphere you might have been able to get some interesting reflections and refractions going.</td>', 'As a photo of rope, this works well. Good detail and nicely framed. But the "glass" element is a bit lacking, unfortunately. If it had been a cleaner, more transparent sphere you might have been able to get some interesting reflections and refractions going.', '2006-07-03 01:50:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2576636, 354361, 61413, '<td valign="top">Glass?</td>', 'Glass?', '2006-07-03 01:50:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2576662, 354271, 61413, '<td valign="top">All the detail here is very clear and crisp - focus, contrast, everything is spot-on.<br/> <br/>But there''s just <i>too much</i> happening for my taste. If there was one central feature that stood out, which the others complemented and led your eye towards, then it would be great. But as it stands, they''re all competing with one another.</td>', 'All the detail here is very clear and crisp - focus, contrast, everything is spot-on. But there''s just too much happening for my taste. If there was one central feature that stood out, which the others complemented and led your eye towards, then it would be great. But as it stands, they''re all competing with one another.', '2006-07-03 01:54:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2576712, 352859, 61413, '<td valign="top">This is quite absorbing. The simplicity of the two colours contrasts with the complexity and randomness of the shards of glass.<br/> <br/>But it does leave me feeling puzzled and a little dissatisfied. I can''t quite grasp the theme of purpose of the shot. It feel to me more like a technically excellent composition in search of a message. But that''s just my gut reaction, it may work for others...</td>', 'This is quite absorbing. The simplicity of the two colours contrasts with the complexity and randomness of the shards of glass. But it does leave me feeling puzzled and a little dissatisfied. I can''t quite grasp the theme of purpose of the shot. It feel to me more like a technically excellent composition in search of a message. But that''s just my gut reaction, it may work for others...', '2006-07-03 02:00:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2576832, 353837, 61413, '<td valign="top">Dunny? Must be an Aussie!<br/> <br/>I love the way the flowers behind the glass seem to align so well with the patterns within the glass - that''s a neat trick.<br/> <br/>It''s a shame that the shot is slightly looking down on the window, though; making the glass look not quite rectangular.</td>', 'Dunny? Must be an Aussie! I love the way the flowers behind the glass seem to align so well with the patterns within the glass - that''s a neat trick. It''s a shame that the shot is slightly looking down on the window, though; making the glass look not quite rectangular.', '2006-07-03 02:19:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2576892, 354294, 61413, '<td valign="top">A great shot - well framed, exposed, etc.<br/> <br/>I love the blues and yellows of the blowtorch flames, and the reflections on the glass. And the whole orange ambience of the shot creates a sense of a hot, stuffy, industrial kind of scene. The understated presence of the tools over on the right hand side enhance this feeling.<br/> <br/>I can''t help wondering, though, if the finished product is intended to contain a liquid... :-)</td>', 'A great shot - well framed, exposed, etc. I love the blues and yellows of the blowtorch flames, and the reflections on the glass. And the whole orange ambience of the shot creates a sense of a hot, stuffy, industrial kind of scene. The understated presence of the tools over on the right hand side enhance this feeling. I can''t help wondering, though, if the finished product is intended to contain a liquid... :-)', '2006-07-03 02:23:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2576946, 354297, 61413, '<td valign="top">I can feel the heat coming off this photo! The reds and yellows are quite evocative. The moltenness of the blob is nicely conveyed by the way it is slightly flattened at the bottom, too.<br/> <br/>There''s just a hint of something in the background over on the right hand side, in what looks like is trying to be a black background. This is a little distracting, but it''s very faint.</td>', 'I can feel the heat coming off this photo! The reds and yellows are quite evocative. The moltenness of the blob is nicely conveyed by the way it is slightly flattened at the bottom, too. There''s just a hint of something in the background over on the right hand side, in what looks like is trying to be a black background. This is a little distracting, but it''s very faint.', '2006-07-03 02:27:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2576963, 353250, 61413, '<td valign="top">I think the idea and technical execution of this shot are both great. The framing is spot on, monochrome was the right choice, and the set-piece use of the mirror was great.<br/> <br/>But someone forgot to tell the woman about the "passion" bit. It looks like she is much more concerned with the camera than with the guy.</td>', 'I think the idea and technical execution of this shot are both great. The framing is spot on, monochrome was the right choice, and the set-piece use of the mirror was great. But someone forgot to tell the woman about the "passion" bit. It looks like she is much more concerned with the camera than with the guy.', '2006-07-03 02:31:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2576965, 354634, 24454, '<td valign="top">This is the first photo I''ve seen in this challenge where instantly I thought:  RIBBON!    It HAS to win!   It stands out in this challenge in a HUGE way!!   Beautiful colors, lighting, focus. concept.  Spectacular work!  10!</td>', 'This is the first photo I''ve seen in this challenge where instantly I thought:  RIBBON!    It HAS to win!   It stands out in this challenge in a HUGE way!!   Beautiful colors, lighting, focus. concept.  Spectacular work!  10!', '2006-07-03 02:31:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2576981, 354621, 61413, '<td valign="top">This is stunning. Striking use of strong red, yellow and green, and a real sense of something fascinating lurking in the reflection.<br/> <br/>It''s a shame there''s no way of eliminating the photographer''s reflection from a shot like this (at least, not without breaking the basic-editing rules, that I know of). But it isn''t intrusive.<br/> <br/>But, unless my monitor is set up incorrectly, it''s not quite spherical...</td>', 'This is stunning. Striking use of strong red, yellow and green, and a real sense of something fascinating lurking in the reflection. It''s a shame there''s no way of eliminating the photographer''s reflection from a shot like this (at least, not without breaking the basic-editing rules, that I know of). But it isn''t intrusive. But, unless my monitor is set up incorrectly, it''s not quite spherical...', '2006-07-03 02:35:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2577001, 354075, 24454, '<td valign="top">Awesome!  One of the few I''ve seen in this challenge that look like ribbon winners!  Fantastic job!  Hey.. .how''d you get that leaf and butterfly in there  :)   Hope you explained.  How amazing!  10</td>', 'Awesome!  One of the few I''ve seen in this challenge that look like ribbon winners!  Fantastic job!  Hey.. .how''d you get that leaf and butterfly in there  :)   Hope you explained.  How amazing!  10', '2006-07-03 02:36:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2577042, 353584, 61413, '<td valign="top">This is a nice, powerful shot.<br/> <br/>I might have experimented with making it a bit less symmetrical - maybe making it 1 1/2 or 1 2/3 tiles wide, rather than 2. But perhaps you tried that, and it didn''t work so well.<br/> <br/>The rain on the glass doesn''t quite come off though - I spent a while wondering if it was rain, or just dirt. I think using water on the glass is a powerful addition to the composition, but maybe make it a bit bigger and more obvious somehow.</td>', 'This is a nice, powerful shot. I might have experimented with making it a bit less symmetrical - maybe making it 1 1/2 or 1 2/3 tiles wide, rather than 2. But perhaps you tried that, and it didn''t work so well. The rain on the glass doesn''t quite come off though - I spent a while wondering if it was rain, or just dirt. I think using water on the glass is a powerful addition to the composition, but maybe make it a bit bigger and more obvious somehow.', '2006-07-03 02:39:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2577078, 354450, 61413, '<td valign="top">Great idea, well executed.<br/> <br/>The only thing I would have tried would be cropping more tightly. I''m not sure that we need to see the whole of that 478 thing (whatever it is) in the background, when it is so well represented through the lenses and their reflections - maybe just enough of it to provide some context to what we are seeing through the lenses.</td>', 'Great idea, well executed. The only thing I would have tried would be cropping more tightly. I''m not sure that we need to see the whole of that 478 thing (whatever it is) in the background, when it is so well represented through the lenses and their reflections - maybe just enough of it to provide some context to what we are seeing through the lenses.', '2006-07-03 02:42:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2577109, 354365, 61413, '<td valign="top">A beautiful piece of still-life, but is it glass?<br/> <br/>I guess it must be, or you wouldn''t have enetered it. But there''s not many "glassy" things going on.</td>', 'A beautiful piece of still-life, but is it glass? I guess it must be, or you wouldn''t have enetered it. But there''s not many "glassy" things going on.', '2006-07-03 02:44:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2577140, 354506, 40679, '<td valign="top">quite a simplistic image. I like the seperate reflections in the window.</td>', 'quite a simplistic image. I like the seperate reflections in the window.', '2006-07-03 02:46:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2577151, 354212, 40679, '<td valign="top">nice colors in the reflection! not wuite sure about the sudden cut from the reflection.</td>', 'nice colors in the reflection! not wuite sure about the sudden cut from the reflection.', '2006-07-03 02:47:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2577157, 354690, 40679, '<td valign="top">you did a great job lighting your entry. bumping up :)</td>', 'you did a great job lighting your entry. bumping up :)', '2006-07-03 02:48:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2577165, 354623, 40679, '<td valign="top">this is a creative background, I like the colors &amp; different tones in it. the marble coule be a bit more out of the centre.</td>', 'this is a creative background, I like the colors & different tones in it. the marble coule be a bit more out of the centre.', '2006-07-03 02:48:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2577172, 354708, 40679, '<td valign="top">hmm the letters aren''t tasksharp, that would''ve been nice.</td>', 'hmm the letters aren''t tasksharp, that would''ve been nice.', '2006-07-03 02:49:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2577181, 353207, 40679, '<td valign="top">you did a nice job in the colors, but the compo is a bit busy</td>', 'you did a nice job in the colors, but the compo is a bit busy', '2006-07-03 02:49:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2577187, 354632, 61413, '<td valign="top">The subdued use of blues and golds works well here, creating a serene ambience.<br/> <br/>I would have cropped a little differently, though - leaving just a bit more of a gap at the top, and cropping closely to the lowest point of the blue petal''s reflection at the bottom.<br/> <br/>And I''m a bit puzzled about what the thing above the flower <i>is</i> - maybe a different angle would''ve left me a little more enlightened.</td>', 'The subdued use of blues and golds works well here, creating a serene ambience. I would have cropped a little differently, though - leaving just a bit more of a gap at the top, and cropping closely to the lowest point of the blue petal''s reflection at the bottom. And I''m a bit puzzled about what the thing above the flower is - maybe a different angle would''ve left me a little more enlightened.', '2006-07-03 02:50:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2577210, 354549, 40679, '<td valign="top">pretty bright colors! not really sure what I''m looking at ;-)</td>', 'pretty bright colors! not really sure what I''m looking at ;-)', '2006-07-03 02:51:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2577224, 351231, 40679, '<td valign="top">this is my 2nd look at youor entry and I must say I like it better then while voting. I think it would be nice to have some more clouds thrue the window. still, I likie it. bumping up :)</td>', 'this is my 2nd look at youor entry and I must say I like it better then while voting. I think it would be nice to have some more clouds thrue the window. still, I likie it. bumping up :)', '2006-07-03 02:52:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2577229, 354546, 61413, '<td valign="top">A nice moody shot, which the dirty glass helps to enhance.<br/> <br/>I would have cropped much more tightly from the top. There''s a lot of nothing happening up there. And maybe trimmed back on how much of the outside we can see - just enough to provide a frame. I think the space on the right works well, though; opening up a sense of the subject staring into empty space.</td>', 'A nice moody shot, which the dirty glass helps to enhance. I would have cropped much more tightly from the top. There''s a lot of nothing happening up there. And maybe trimmed back on how much of the outside we can see - just enough to provide a frame. I think the space on the right works well, though; opening up a sense of the subject staring into empty space.', '2006-07-03 02:53:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2577242, 354604, 61413, '<td valign="top">Where''s the glass? I see water...</td>', 'Where''s the glass? I see water...', '2006-07-03 02:53:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2577270, 351226, 61413, '<td valign="top">Lots of intriguing reflection and refraction going on here. And nicely framed; though perhaps just a bit untidy in the bottom right, with elements drifting out of frame.</td>', 'Lots of intriguing reflection and refraction going on here. And nicely framed; though perhaps just a bit untidy in the bottom right, with elements drifting out of frame.', '2006-07-03 02:55:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2577280, 354591, 61413, '<td valign="top">A bold and striking composition, but glass?</td>', 'A bold and striking composition, but glass?', '2006-07-03 02:56:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2577390, 354505, 40679, '<td valign="top">that''s a complex building! I like the blue sky in the background</td>', 'that''s a complex building! I like the blue sky in the background', '2006-07-03 03:06:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2577398, 354433, 40679, '<td valign="top">very simplystic, but I miss a spark.</td>', 'very simplystic, but I miss a spark.', '2006-07-03 03:06:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2577415, 353479, 40679, '<td valign="top">nice different hues of blue in your entry, but it seems to be a bit over-processsed.</td>', 'nice different hues of blue in your entry, but it seems to be a bit over-processsed.', '2006-07-03 03:08:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2577424, 353223, 40679, '<td valign="top">cute! I think cropping the window frame would be a bit better.</td>', 'cute! I think cropping the window frame would be a bit better.', '2006-07-03 03:09:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2577564, 354124, 40679, '<td valign="top">your entry is too much OOF and could use some contrast.</td>', 'your entry is too much OOF and could use some contrast.', '2006-07-03 03:40:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2577574, 354585, 40679, '<td valign="top">nice yellows in your entry, but I miss some sharpness &amp; I think it would be more in balane when the lantarn would be under or above the horizon</td>', 'nice yellows in your entry, but I miss some sharpness & I think it would be more in balane when the lantarn would be under or above the horizon', '2006-07-03 03:43:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2577577, 354405, 40679, '<td valign="top">could use a bit more contrast and the reflection isn''t really pectacular IMO</td>', 'could use a bit more contrast and the reflection isn''t really pectacular IMO', '2006-07-03 03:43:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2577579, 353590, 60302, '<td valign="top">i think the setting needs  more.  background, lighting, etc.</td>', 'i think the setting needs  more.  background, lighting, etc.', '2006-07-03 03:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2577584, 353993, 40679, '<td valign="top">I think looking up and leaving the trees out of the photo would''ve done better.</td>', 'I think looking up and leaving the trees out of the photo would''ve done better.', '2006-07-03 03:44:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2577585, 354693, 60302, '<td valign="top">nice shot and good choise of exposure.</td>', 'nice shot and good choise of exposure.', '2006-07-03 03:44:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2577587, 352406, 60302, '<td valign="top">a bit too contrived for my tastes.</td>', 'a bit too contrived for my tastes.', '2006-07-03 03:45:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2577590, 354691, 40679, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, but your entry doesn''t appeal to me, sorry.</td>', 'I like the idea, but your entry doesn''t appeal to me, sorry.', '2006-07-03 03:45:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2577594, 354311, 60302, '<td valign="top">nice.  i tried a similar shot and know how hard it is to pull off.</td>', 'nice.  i tried a similar shot and know how hard it is to pull off.', '2006-07-03 03:45:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2577595, 354332, 40679, '<td valign="top">I think your entry is a bit too busy with the reflection and the things behind the window.</td>', 'I think your entry is a bit too busy with the reflection and the things behind the window.', '2006-07-03 03:45:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2577598, 354746, 60302, '<td valign="top">beautiful expression and choice of tone.</td>', 'beautiful expression and choice of tone.', '2006-07-03 03:45:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2577602, 354537, 40679, '<td valign="top">cute :) the swan seems out of focus and is placed exactly in the center of the image. I like the light</td>', 'cute :) the swan seems out of focus and is placed exactly in the center of the image. I like the light', '2006-07-03 03:46:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2577604, 353980, 60302, '<td valign="top">not a standout subject matter.</td>', 'not a standout subject matter.', '2006-07-03 03:46:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2577607, 354332, 61413, '<td valign="top">I think making this monochrome was the right choice.<br/> <br/>You''ve captured the essence of window reflection well here. My eye is drawn back and forth between items on either side of the glass. Very tricky to achieve, I imagine.</td>', 'I think making this monochrome was the right choice. You''ve captured the essence of window reflection well here. My eye is drawn back and forth between items on either side of the glass. Very tricky to achieve, I imagine.', '2006-07-03 03:46:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2577611, 353358, 60302, '<td valign="top">why a camera lens?  nice idea, but maybe a broader eye for subject?</td>', 'why a camera lens?  nice idea, but maybe a broader eye for subject?', '2006-07-03 03:47:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2577614, 353590, 18552, '<td valign="top">This is very pretty and well done. I like it a lot.</td>', 'This is very pretty and well done. I like it a lot.', '2006-07-03 03:47:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2577617, 354084, 60302, '<td valign="top">eye wants something to focus on (yeah, i know that''s the point, but i can''t lie and say i like it).</td>', 'eye wants something to focus on (yeah, i know that''s the point, but i can''t lie and say i like it).', '2006-07-03 03:48:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2577627, 354631, 40679, '<td valign="top">this could''ve been a good one if it weren''t overprocessed. maybe you could''ve get the yellow reflection out of the picture by desaturating the yellows.</td>', 'this could''ve been a good one if it weren''t overprocessed. maybe you could''ve get the yellow reflection out of the picture by desaturating the yellows.', '2006-07-03 03:50:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2577630, 354111, 40679, '<td valign="top">I don''t really see the glass</td>', 'I don''t really see the glass', '2006-07-03 03:50:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2577637, 354610, 40679, '<td valign="top">sharpness looks ok, but you might wanna pay some attention to the background. maybe you could place a black / blue piece of paper at the back and bottom of your subject :)</td>', 'sharpness looks ok, but you might wanna pay some attention to the background. maybe you could place a black / blue piece of paper at the back and bottom of your subject :)', '2006-07-03 03:51:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2577646, 354721, 40679, '<td valign="top">no title? hmm, strange. anyway, the object looks nice, but I think you cou;d''ve got more out of it, by focussing at the front part of the object &amp; pay some attention to the background.</td>', 'no title? hmm, strange. anyway, the object looks nice, but I think you cou;d''ve got more out of it, by focussing at the front part of the object & pay some attention to the background.', '2006-07-03 03:52:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2577650, 353398, 40679, '<td valign="top">maybe zooming in to the knob, leaving the keyhole into the image, would''ve been better?</td>', 'maybe zooming in to the knob, leaving the keyhole into the image, would''ve been better?', '2006-07-03 03:53:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2577651, 352697, 61413, '<td valign="top">The colours here are very seductive. White segues to yellow, orange, brown, then finally black - very hypnotic. It would make for an interesting duotone.<br/> <br/>I''m not sure the reflection quite works, though. Too much of a mirror image. Maybe if the shot had been taken from higher up, or if the reflection had added a unique tone, it might''ve worked better. You could even have some fun taking this shot from different angles, and seeing how they look upside down...</td>', 'The colours here are very seductive. White segues to yellow, orange, brown, then finally black - very hypnotic. It would make for an interesting duotone. I''m not sure the reflection quite works, though. Too much of a mirror image. Maybe if the shot had been taken from higher up, or if the reflection had added a unique tone, it might''ve worked better. You could even have some fun taking this shot from different angles, and seeing how they look upside down...', '2006-07-03 03:53:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2577661, 354224, 18552, '<td valign="top">This is really pretty - so abstract.</td>', 'This is really pretty - so abstract.', '2006-07-03 03:55:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2577662, 354531, 61413, '<td valign="top">A nice piece of still life. And a story being told - you can imagine somebody somewhere anxiously searching through their pockets...<br/> <br/>But not much happening with the glass, as such. And I find I''m a bit distracted by how unnaturally flat the sand is.</td>', 'A nice piece of still life. And a story being told - you can imagine somebody somewhere anxiously searching through their pockets... But not much happening with the glass, as such. And I find I''m a bit distracted by how unnaturally flat the sand is.', '2006-07-03 03:55:40.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(2577663, 354271, 18552, '<td valign="top">How lovely!</td>', 'How lovely!', '2006-07-03 03:55:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2577741, 353217, 9285, '<td valign="top">I love the idea of having the reflection on the glass. Nice try. Might want to work a little on the contrast and saturation of the image.. the "dot" at the lower right hand corner is a little distracting. :)</td>', 'I love the idea of having the reflection on the glass. Nice try. Might want to work a little on the contrast and saturation of the image.. the "dot" at the lower right hand corner is a little distracting. :)', '2006-07-03 04:20:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2577788, 353433, 38732, '<td valign="top">I like the B/W, but I''d prefer a bit more sharpness.</td>', 'I like the B/W, but I''d prefer a bit more sharpness.', '2006-07-03 04:40:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2577790, 354657, 38732, '<td valign="top">I like the red cast, but would prefer a bit more contrast between the pieces and the board.</td>', 'I like the red cast, but would prefer a bit more contrast between the pieces and the board.', '2006-07-03 04:40:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2577791, 353044, 38732, '<td valign="top">Like the DOF here.</td>', 'Like the DOF here.', '2006-07-03 04:41:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2577797, 354651, 38732, '<td valign="top">There are some spots on your reflective surface that should probably have been cleaned off to make this a cleaner shot.  The subject looks a little fuzzy to me, of course I could just need glasses :)</td>', 'There are some spots on your reflective surface that should probably have been cleaned off to make this a cleaner shot.  The subject looks a little fuzzy to me, of course I could just need glasses :)', '2006-07-03 04:43:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2577798, 354630, 38732, '<td valign="top">Probably going to get a validation on this for the point of light on the word "glass", but not from me.  I''d like to know how you did that.</td>', 'Probably going to get a validation on this for the point of light on the word "glass", but not from me.  I''d like to know how you did that.', '2006-07-03 04:43:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2577799, 353570, 38732, '<td valign="top">I''d like to see a bit more sharpness.</td>', 'I''d like to see a bit more sharpness.', '2006-07-03 04:43:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2577800, 351305, 38732, '<td valign="top">I like how the marbles are framed by the jar''s opening. Glass within glass.  Definately fits the challenge :)</td>', 'I like how the marbles are framed by the jar''s opening. Glass within glass.  Definately fits the challenge :)', '2006-07-03 04:43:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2577802, 351265, 38732, '<td valign="top">I think if the gem was more in focus and I could see more of its detail, this would be an awesome shot.</td>', 'I think if the gem was more in focus and I could see more of its detail, this would be an awesome shot.', '2006-07-03 04:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2577808, 353736, 38732, '<td valign="top">I like the mild reddish tint.  This would probably make for a good stock photo.  Bumping up!</td>', 'I like the mild reddish tint.  This would probably make for a good stock photo.  Bumping up!', '2006-07-03 04:47:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2577809, 351666, 38732, '<td valign="top">Nice colour and I like the glow of the letters.</td>', 'Nice colour and I like the glow of the letters.', '2006-07-03 04:47:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2577810, 354514, 38732, '<td valign="top">Like the texture in this shot.</td>', 'Like the texture in this shot.', '2006-07-03 04:47:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2577812, 354332, 38732, '<td valign="top">I think the B/W makes this shot.  The reflections to me are a little busy, but the title is very fitting.</td>', 'I think the B/W makes this shot.  The reflections to me are a little busy, but the title is very fitting.', '2006-07-03 04:47:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2577813, 354586, 38732, '<td valign="top">I think the background is a little too dark and the subject almost blends in with it.  Perhaps a lighter colour background would have given the rose the attention is deserves.</td>', 'I think the background is a little too dark and the subject almost blends in with it.  Perhaps a lighter colour background would have given the rose the attention is deserves.', '2006-07-03 04:47:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2577814, 354319, 38732, '<td valign="top">I would prefer if the subject was a bit sharper.</td>', 'I would prefer if the subject was a bit sharper.', '2006-07-03 04:47:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2577816, 354231, 38732, '<td valign="top">Like the colours and the reflections in this shot.  Bumping up!</td>', 'Like the colours and the reflections in this shot.  Bumping up!', '2006-07-03 04:47:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2577817, 354289, 38732, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot.  I wonder what the effect would be like if the focus was on the hole in the glass instead of the person.  Bumping up!</td>', 'Interesting shot.  I wonder what the effect would be like if the focus was on the hole in the glass instead of the person.  Bumping up!', '2006-07-03 04:47:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2577819, 354073, 38732, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot.  Those must be some pretty big eggs :)</td>', 'Interesting shot.  Those must be some pretty big eggs :)', '2006-07-03 04:47:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2577820, 353960, 38732, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately the clump of dirt or grass(?) is covering up most of the bottle, taking away much of the focus on the main subject.  I really like the the constrast between the blue-black sky and the reddish-brown ground.</td>', 'Unfortunately the clump of dirt or grass(?) is covering up most of the bottle, taking away much of the focus on the main subject.  I really like the the constrast between the blue-black sky and the reddish-brown ground.', '2006-07-03 04:48:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2577821, 354361, 38732, '<td valign="top">Uh, nice cleavage shot? :)<br/> <br/>Would have liked to see a tighter shot of the actual subject.</td>', 'Uh, nice cleavage shot? :) Would have liked to see a tighter shot of the actual subject.', '2006-07-03 04:48:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2577822, 354560, 38732, '<td valign="top">Love the blue colour and the composition of this shot.  Bumping up!</td>', 'Love the blue colour and the composition of this shot.  Bumping up!', '2006-07-03 04:48:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2577823, 353207, 38732, '<td valign="top">Nice bright colours.</td>', 'Nice bright colours.', '2006-07-03 04:48:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2577824, 354535, 38732, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea, but I think a tighter shot of the bulb would have worked better for me.  There''s too much background and not enough of the subject for my taste.</td>', 'Interesting idea, but I think a tighter shot of the bulb would have worked better for me.  There''s too much background and not enough of the subject for my taste.', '2006-07-03 04:48:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2577831, 353260, 9285, '<td valign="top">I like the composition but the noise level is a little too high. Should use a tripod or neatimage to post process it. The reflection on the glass ball is nice but if it can be more defined, it''ll be much better. :)</td>', 'I like the composition but the noise level is a little too high. Should use a tripod or neatimage to post process it. The reflection on the glass ball is nice but if it can be more defined, it''ll be much better. :)', '2006-07-03 04:52:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2577860, 354220, 38732, '<td valign="top">I like the blue colour and the shapes in this shot.  Nice composition.</td>', 'I like the blue colour and the shapes in this shot.  Nice composition.', '2006-07-03 05:17:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2577865, 354590, 38732, '<td valign="top">Creative shot.  I like the lighting and the B/W really works for me.  Bumping up!</td>', 'Creative shot.  I like the lighting and the B/W really works for me.  Bumping up!', '2006-07-03 05:19:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2577877, 354408, 38732, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot.  I like the colours.  Perhaps a tighter crop so I could see more of the glass objects.</td>', 'Interesting shot.  I like the colours.  Perhaps a tighter crop so I could see more of the glass objects.', '2006-07-03 05:25:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2577892, 354623, 38732, '<td valign="top">I really like the colouring in this shot.</td>', 'I really like the colouring in this shot.', '2006-07-03 05:32:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2577893, 354615, 38732, '<td valign="top">Like the black and white and the title :)</td>', 'Like the black and white and the title :)', '2006-07-03 05:34:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2577919, 353518, 38732, '<td valign="top">A little more focus on the subject would make this better I think.  Love the bright colours though.</td>', 'A little more focus on the subject would make this better I think.  Love the bright colours though.', '2006-07-03 05:45:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2577922, 354449, 38732, '<td valign="top">Nice detail of the glass edge.  There appears to be quite a bit of noise in the shot, though it could just be my crappy monitor :)</td>', 'Nice detail of the glass edge.  There appears to be quite a bit of noise in the shot, though it could just be my crappy monitor :)', '2006-07-03 05:46:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2577950, 353043, 38732, '<td valign="top">Like the DOF.</td>', 'Like the DOF.', '2006-07-03 05:56:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2578071, 354650, 27482, '<td valign="top">I don´t really get the title, where is the heart?  Not that it matters, I usually ignore titles except for the really funny ones wich may sway my vote upwards but never downwards.  <br/> <br/>Anyhow, like the shot but think I might have liked it even more if it were more "frozen", the slight motion blur isn´t to my taste.  Nice effort though and you got a 6 from me.</td>', 'I don´t really get the title, where is the heart?  Not that it matters, I usually ignore titles except for the really funny ones wich may sway my vote upwards but never downwards.   Anyhow, like the shot but think I might have liked it even more if it were more "frozen", the slight motion blur isn´t to my taste.  Nice effort though and you got a 6 from me.', '2006-07-03 08:06:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2578077, 353760, 61413, '<td valign="top">I can''t help but feel that this would have worked better as a colour shot. There''s a nice interplay of light &amp; dark happening through the open window, which blends into light &amp; dark respectively through each pane of glass. With the original greens and browns intact, this would''ve made the panes much more interesting, I think.</td>', 'I can''t help but feel that this would have worked better as a colour shot. There''s a nice interplay of light & dark happening through the open window, which blends into light & dark respectively through each pane of glass. With the original greens and browns intact, this would''ve made the panes much more interesting, I think.', '2006-07-03 08:10:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2578080, 354730, 61413, '<td valign="top">The multiple reflections of the sun create a compelling effect, and the whole is nicely framed, with the major diagonal flow crossing the band of cloud. I particularly like the way the topmost sunburst sits almost directly in front of the topmost whisp of cloud.<br/> <br/>It looks more like highly polished steel than glass, though...</td>', 'The multiple reflections of the sun create a compelling effect, and the whole is nicely framed, with the major diagonal flow crossing the band of cloud. I particularly like the way the topmost sunburst sits almost directly in front of the topmost whisp of cloud. It looks more like highly polished steel than glass, though...', '2006-07-03 08:15:24.000000', NULL, 1),
