(2580645, 354449, 61413, '<td valign="top">A nice shot, let down just a little by the loss of focus at the tip of the glass. I can never get that right with macro shots either!<br/> <br/>I might have framed it a little differently, perhaps with the glass at more of an angle and filling less of the frame.<br/> <br/>But it''s a great choice of subject matter for a macro shot - lots of stuff to look at in the broken edge of the glass.</td>', 'A nice shot, let down just a little by the loss of focus at the tip of the glass. I can never get that right with macro shots either! I might have framed it a little differently, perhaps with the glass at more of an angle and filling less of the frame. But it''s a great choice of subject matter for a macro shot - lots of stuff to look at in the broken edge of the glass.', '2006-07-03 20:26:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2580646, 353587, 57381, '<td valign="top">Meets Challenge: 1/1<br/>Lighting: 1/2<br/>Focus: 2/2<br/>Creativity: 2/2<br/>Aesthetics: 2/3</td>', 'Meets Challenge: 1/1Lighting: 1/2Focus: 2/2Creativity: 2/2Aesthetics: 2/3', '2006-07-03 20:26:27.000000', NULL, 1),
