(2580704, 352772, 57381, '<td valign="top">Meets Challenge: 1/1<br/>Lighting: 2/2<br/>Focus: 1/2<br/>Creativity: 1/2<br/>Aesthetics: 3/3</td>', 'Meets Challenge: 1/1Lighting: 2/2Focus: 1/2Creativity: 1/2Aesthetics: 3/3', '2006-07-03 20:39:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2580708, 353456, 61413, '<td valign="top">A shot with some great potential. There are some strong, compelling colours here.<br/> <br/>There is also some darker red happening over on the left, and I wonder if the shot would have gained from having this more involved in the composition. Maybe if you''d aimed for a less square aspect-ratio, and introduced more of the darker red on the left, with the pipe as a compositional element to lead us from the left towards the furnace on the right...</td>', 'A shot with some great potential. There are some strong, compelling colours here. There is also some darker red happening over on the left, and I wonder if the shot would have gained from having this more involved in the composition. Maybe if you''d aimed for a less square aspect-ratio, and introduced more of the darker red on the left, with the pipe as a compositional element to lead us from the left towards the furnace on the right...', '2006-07-03 20:40:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2580710, 354537, 57381, '<td valign="top">Meets Challenge: 1/1<br/>Lighting: 1/2<br/>Focus: 0/2<br/>Creativity: 1/2<br/>Aesthetics: 1/3</td>', 'Meets Challenge: 1/1Lighting: 1/2Focus: 0/2Creativity: 1/2Aesthetics: 1/3', '2006-07-03 20:41:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2580714, 353977, 57381, '<td valign="top">Meets Challenge: 1/1<br/>Lighting: 1/2<br/>Focus: 1/2<br/>Creativity: 1/2<br/>Aesthetics: 3/3</td>', 'Meets Challenge: 1/1Lighting: 1/2Focus: 1/2Creativity: 1/2Aesthetics: 3/3', '2006-07-03 20:41:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2580718, 354160, 57381, '<td valign="top">Meets Challenge: 1/1<br/>Lighting: 1/2<br/>Focus: 1/2<br/>Creativity: 2/2<br/>Aesthetics: 1/3</td>', 'Meets Challenge: 1/1Lighting: 1/2Focus: 1/2Creativity: 2/2Aesthetics: 1/3', '2006-07-03 20:43:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2580721, 351305, 57381, '<td valign="top">Meets Challenge: 1/1<br/>Lighting: 1/2<br/>Focus: 2/2<br/>Creativity: 1/2<br/>Aesthetics: 2/3</td>', 'Meets Challenge: 1/1Lighting: 1/2Focus: 2/2Creativity: 1/2Aesthetics: 2/3', '2006-07-03 20:44:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2580735, 354631, 61413, '<td valign="top">This is a marvelous shot. Having a single dominant colour, with just a touch of green here &amp; there, works well. And everything leads the eye to theoval of reflection in the centre, which is great.<br/> <br/>Intriguingly, theres no photographer featuring in the reflection in the central oval - how did you do that with just basic editing? Or maybe it''s really concave (it looks convex), and that''s you tucked away on the left-hand side...</td>', 'This is a marvelous shot. Having a single dominant colour, with just a touch of green here & there, works well. And everything leads the eye to theoval of reflection in the centre, which is great. Intriguingly, theres no photographer featuring in the reflection in the central oval - how did you do that with just basic editing? Or maybe it''s really concave (it looks convex), and that''s you tucked away on the left-hand side...', '2006-07-03 20:47:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2580739, 354075, 31620, '<td valign="top">Excellent photo!!  Well done</td>', 'Excellent photo!!  Well done', '2006-07-03 20:49:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2580745, 351906, 57381, '<td valign="top">Meets Challenge: 1/1<br/>Lighting: 0/2<br/>Focus: 0/2<br/>Creativity: 1/2<br/>Aesthetics: 0/3<br/> <br/>Explanation: With any image I rate that receives 3 or under, I will explain my reasons.<br/> <br/>Lighting: For me, the lighting is too harsh. The flash in the reflection is where my eye is drawn.<br/>Focus: There''s seemingly no particular point that is in focus. Every edge seems blurred, some more than others. It also looks like some places were artificially blurred in post-processing.<br/>Creativity: The idea was good, stringing some jewelery around effectively paints a picture of something more than just a shoe. <br/>Aesthetics: All of the above comments are responsible for the lack of aesthectics for me. Also, the crop doesn''t work for me. The area everything is placed seems off. The white faded framing also distracts. Some people might like that kind of thing, but I don''t generally like any kind of boarder when trying to rate a photo, and it will always detract from the overall quality for me, as I rate purely on the photo itself. 95% of the time a boarder of some kind will lose 1 point for me. It''s a good idea overall, but a larger image size would help, as well as making sure everything is in focus. Try a larger aperture, and bouncing your flash off of something else, or if you can use some studio lighting.</td>', 'Meets Challenge: 1/1Lighting: 0/2Focus: 0/2Creativity: 1/2Aesthetics: 0/3 Explanation: With any image I rate that receives 3 or under, I will explain my reasons. Lighting: For me, the lighting is too harsh. The flash in the reflection is where my eye is drawn.Focus: There''s seemingly no particular point that is in focus. Every edge seems blurred, some more than others. It also looks like some places were artificially blurred in post-processing.Creativity: The idea was good, stringing some jewelery around effectively paints a picture of something more than just a shoe. Aesthetics: All of the above comments are responsible for the lack of aesthectics for me. Also, the crop doesn''t work for me. The area everything is placed seems off. The white faded framing also distracts. Some people might like that kind of thing, but I don''t generally like any kind of boarder when trying to rate a photo, and it will always detract from the overall quality for me, as I rate purely on the photo itself. 95% of the time a boarder of some kind will lose 1 point for me. It''s a good idea overall, but a larger image size would help, as well as making sure everything is in focus. Try a larger aperture, and bouncing your flash off of something else, or if you can use some studio lighting.', '2006-07-03 20:51:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2580746, 354574, 57381, '<td valign="top">Meets Challenge: 1/1<br/>Lighting: 1/2<br/>Focus: 1/2<br/>Creativity: 1/2<br/>Aesthetics: 1/3</td>', 'Meets Challenge: 1/1Lighting: 1/2Focus: 1/2Creativity: 1/2Aesthetics: 1/3', '2006-07-03 20:51:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2580754, 353396, 61413, '<td valign="top">Beautifully composed. And more than a little effort has gone into polishing up the car as well, I''m guessing :-) I love the strong colur theme - ochre counterpointed by sky blue. And the choice of angle is inspired.<br/> <br/>If I was being really picky, I would suggest aiming for a cleaner reflection in the headlight reflector and paintwork. There''s clearly a lot of "stuff" going on behind the camera. The strong blue reflection of the sky in the rim of the headlight works really well, having a clean reflection of the road in the other half of the rim would''ve made it perfect.<br/> <br/>But it is a great shot, no doubt about it.</td>', 'Beautifully composed. And more than a little effort has gone into polishing up the car as well, I''m guessing :-) I love the strong colur theme - ochre counterpointed by sky blue. And the choice of angle is inspired. If I was being really picky, I would suggest aiming for a cleaner reflection in the headlight reflector and paintwork. There''s clearly a lot of "stuff" going on behind the camera. The strong blue reflection of the sky in the rim of the headlight works really well, having a clean reflection of the road in the other half of the rim would''ve made it perfect. But it is a great shot, no doubt about it.', '2006-07-03 20:54:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2580759, 354634, 61413, '<td valign="top">Looks to me like it''s holding a liquid...</td>', 'Looks to me like it''s holding a liquid...', '2006-07-03 20:55:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2580768, 354624, 57381, '<td valign="top">Meets Challenge: 1/1<br/>Lighting: 1/2<br/>Focus: 0/2<br/>Creativity: 0/2<br/>Aesthetics: 0/3<br/> <br/>Explanation: When I rate an image that is below 3, I will offer an explanation.<br/> <br/>Lighting: The lighting is okay in concept. However, the image looks as though it was too dark in the original, so the exposure was cranked up in photoshop, resulting in muggy colours.<br/>Focus: The entire image is a little blurred. A faster shutterspeed and some more light would help.<br/>Creativity: It''s just a bead, slightly off center and is overall unintersting. A photo like this can be quite nice if it meets all technical aspects perfectly. Perfect lighting, focus and framing can definately take a simple object and make it interesting.<br/>Aesthetics: All of the above points, mostly the graininess, muggy colours, high saturation to the point of colour bleeding etc. make the image unappealing. Many product photos are faced with taking a simple object, and making it stunning. Photography can do this. It looks as if this was a crop of a large image not focused on this item in particular. If that''s the case, try a lower iso (50 or 100). Also, external lighting can be helpful in closeups even at moody natural scenes with a sunset. Put a gel over a studio light, or even a lamp, that matches the main colour of the natural light. Bounce the light off of a white card and you can get some more light in your image without washing out the colours.</td>', 'Meets Challenge: 1/1Lighting: 1/2Focus: 0/2Creativity: 0/2Aesthetics: 0/3 Explanation: When I rate an image that is below 3, I will offer an explanation. Lighting: The lighting is okay in concept. However, the image looks as though it was too dark in the original, so the exposure was cranked up in photoshop, resulting in muggy colours.Focus: The entire image is a little blurred. A faster shutterspeed and some more light would help.Creativity: It''s just a bead, slightly off center and is overall unintersting. A photo like this can be quite nice if it meets all technical aspects perfectly. Perfect lighting, focus and framing can definately take a simple object and make it interesting.Aesthetics: All of the above points, mostly the graininess, muggy colours, high saturation to the point of colour bleeding etc. make the image unappealing. Many product photos are faced with taking a simple object, and making it stunning. Photography can do this. It looks as if this was a crop of a large image not focused on this item in particular. If that''s the case, try a lower iso (50 or 100). Also, external lighting can be helpful in closeups even at moody natural scenes with a sunset. Put a gel over a studio light, or even a lamp, that matches the main colour of the natural light. Bounce the light off of a white card and you can get some more light in your image without washing out the colours.', '2006-07-03 20:59:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2580770, 354672, 57381, '<td valign="top">Meets Challenge: 1/1<br/>Lighting: 1/2<br/>Focus: 1/2<br/>Creativity: 1/2<br/>Aesthetics: 2/3</td>', 'Meets Challenge: 1/1Lighting: 1/2Focus: 1/2Creativity: 1/2Aesthetics: 2/3', '2006-07-03 20:59:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2580771, 354617, 57381, '<td valign="top">Meets Challenge: 1/1<br/>Lighting: 1/2<br/>Focus: 1/2<br/>Creativity: 1/2<br/>Aesthetics: 2/3<br/> <br/>I was wondering when I was going to see a picture of a lens!</td>', 'Meets Challenge: 1/1Lighting: 1/2Focus: 1/2Creativity: 1/2Aesthetics: 2/3 I was wondering when I was going to see a picture of a lens!', '2006-07-03 21:00:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2580775, 354119, 61413, '<td valign="top">At the risk of appearing prurient, I think this is a great shot that would have been even better if the woman behind the glass had been naked. Modesty would have been well-served with the lighting as it is, and the eroticism of nudity just out of reach (both visually and physically) beyond the barrier of the glass would''ve made for a great piece of art.<br/> <br/>But it''s still very good. Colour, framing, border, theme - all great.</td>', 'At the risk of appearing prurient, I think this is a great shot that would have been even better if the woman behind the glass had been naked. Modesty would have been well-served with the lighting as it is, and the eroticism of nudity just out of reach (both visually and physically) beyond the barrier of the glass would''ve made for a great piece of art. But it''s still very good. Colour, framing, border, theme - all great.', '2006-07-03 21:01:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2580776, 354504, 61413, '<td valign="top">Glass?</td>', 'Glass?', '2006-07-03 21:01:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2580786, 353043, 57381, '<td valign="top">Meets Challenge: 1/1<br/>Lighting: 1/2<br/>Focus: 1/2<br/>Creativity: 1/2<br/>Aesthetics: 1/3<br/> <br/>The reflection could have been a little sharper for me, and more DOF to encompass the frame of the mirror. Good composition and placement of the subject. I might have liked to see the mirror not cut off at the very tip. But my eye is drawn to the reflection of the subjects eyes. Nice work.</td>', 'Meets Challenge: 1/1Lighting: 1/2Focus: 1/2Creativity: 1/2Aesthetics: 1/3 The reflection could have been a little sharper for me, and more DOF to encompass the frame of the mirror. Good composition and placement of the subject. I might have liked to see the mirror not cut off at the very tip. But my eye is drawn to the reflection of the subjects eyes. Nice work.', '2006-07-03 21:03:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2580789, 352254, 57381, '<td valign="top">Meets Challenge: 1/1<br/>Lighting: 1/2<br/>Focus: 2/2<br/>Creativity: 1/2<br/>Aesthetics: 2/3</td>', 'Meets Challenge: 1/1Lighting: 1/2Focus: 2/2Creativity: 1/2Aesthetics: 2/3', '2006-07-03 21:03:53.000000', NULL, 1),
