(2582098, 354119, 20168, '<td valign="top">A classy entry though the title doesn''t fit IMO. Lighting is good except for the lowest portion of her thigh. The removal of arms also makes this out to be some kind of modern day Venus d''Milo. 7</td>', 'A classy entry though the title doesn''t fit IMO. Lighting is good except for the lowest portion of her thigh. The removal of arms also makes this out to be some kind of modern day Venus d''Milo. 7', '2006-07-04 02:57:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2582107, 353250, 20168, '<td valign="top">Odd, but to my eye, the two in the photo don''t seem very passionate in their embrace; rather, they seemed posed, a bit staged, with the woman''s eyes looking blandly at the photographer, almost removed from the man''s one handed "embrace". Good concept which could use some work in better coaching the models to set the appropriate mood.</td>', 'Odd, but to my eye, the two in the photo don''t seem very passionate in their embrace; rather, they seemed posed, a bit staged, with the woman''s eyes looking blandly at the photographer, almost removed from the man''s one handed "embrace". Good concept which could use some work in better coaching the models to set the appropriate mood.', '2006-07-04 03:00:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2582117, 352697, 40320, '<td valign="top">Nice contemporary look. My only suggestion is that I would have scored it a a point higher if the subject was a little more balanced in the photo.  Just a tad off for my eyes but that could just be me. Otherwise, you did a fine job.</td>', 'Nice contemporary look. My only suggestion is that I would have scored it a a point higher if the subject was a little more balanced in the photo.  Just a tad off for my eyes but that could just be me. Otherwise, you did a fine job.', '2006-07-04 03:04:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2582187, 354362, 59343, '<td valign="top">This is such a cool idea.  I love it.  I wish the lettering could have come out right side up (I realize it''s a function of the optics at work).  Very cool idea.</td>', 'This is such a cool idea.  I love it.  I wish the lettering could have come out right side up (I realize it''s a function of the optics at work).  Very cool idea.', '2006-07-04 03:59:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2582191, 354231, 59343, '<td valign="top">what and where is that?  On technical merits alone this photo does well--it''s interesting to look at and has a nice texture.  I''m guessing this is done with perspective to make the glass ball look larger--but it''s very well done.  Nice colors of the sky reflected in the sand as well.</td>', 'what and where is that?  On technical merits alone this photo does well--it''s interesting to look at and has a nice texture.  I''m guessing this is done with perspective to make the glass ball look larger--but it''s very well done.  Nice colors of the sky reflected in the sand as well.', '2006-07-04 04:01:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2582194, 353908, 59343, '<td valign="top">hmm...this is an interesting idea--but I just don''t see much of a "subject"  If it''s the window directly in the center then I think the two windows on either side should be cropped out--as well as the black line across the bottom.  It''s also not in good focus and the detail is lacking.</td>', 'hmm...this is an interesting idea--but I just don''t see much of a "subject"  If it''s the window directly in the center then I think the two windows on either side should be cropped out--as well as the black line across the bottom.  It''s also not in good focus and the detail is lacking.', '2006-07-04 04:03:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2582365, 354231, 28494, '<td valign="top">This is excellent! Beautiful work, truly.</td>', 'This is excellent! Beautiful work, truly.', '2006-07-04 05:44:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2582368, 352390, 28494, '<td valign="top">This is one of my personal favourites. Great work!</td>', 'This is one of my personal favourites. Great work!', '2006-07-04 05:45:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2582373, 354640, 28494, '<td valign="top">This is my absolute favourite in the entire challenge. It''s perfect! <br/> <br/>Well, ok.. perfect except for that white dot in the water.. on the left. ;P But yes, wonderful work. I really like this one!</td>', 'This is my absolute favourite in the entire challenge. It''s perfect!  Well, ok.. perfect except for that white dot in the water.. on the left. ;P But yes, wonderful work. I really like this one!', '2006-07-04 05:45:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2582377, 354075, 28494, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot! You''ve done a really good job of this. The lighting is perfect.</td>', 'Excellent shot! You''ve done a really good job of this. The lighting is perfect.', '2006-07-04 05:46:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2582379, 354718, 28494, '<td valign="top">Great shot. This is one of my personal favourites from this contest. Really well done. You''ve taken an otherwise dull subject and turned it into something interesting to look at.</td>', 'Great shot. This is one of my personal favourites from this contest. Really well done. You''ve taken an otherwise dull subject and turned it into something interesting to look at.', '2006-07-04 05:47:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2582383, 354267, 28494, '<td valign="top">Great shot! :)</td>', 'Great shot! :)', '2006-07-04 05:48:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2582558, 352845, 12930, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot.Is there any chance of a night time shot here,it could work really well.</td>', 'I like this a lot.Is there any chance of a night time shot here,it could work really well.', '2006-07-04 06:36:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2582567, 351305, 61413, '<td valign="top">Good strong use of colour. It''s a shame that the marble in the centre of the composition is so chipped.</td>', 'Good strong use of colour. It''s a shame that the marble in the centre of the composition is so chipped.', '2006-07-04 06:40:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2582587, 354404, 61413, '<td valign="top">This is marvelous. Getting such sharp focus on the marbles in the air must''ve been difficult, I imagine - especially with a fast shutter-speed, wide aperture shot like this. Did you really just throw them in the air?<br/> <br/>Getting the whisps of cloud on the right to counterbalance the marbles on the left is great. It looks like it was shot with the sun behind you, to get light on the marbles and stop them appearing silhouetted against the sky; correct?</td>', 'This is marvelous. Getting such sharp focus on the marbles in the air must''ve been difficult, I imagine - especially with a fast shutter-speed, wide aperture shot like this. Did you really just throw them in the air? Getting the whisps of cloud on the right to counterbalance the marbles on the left is great. It looks like it was shot with the sun behind you, to get light on the marbles and stop them appearing silhouetted against the sky; correct?', '2006-07-04 06:47:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2582595, 354312, 61413, '<td valign="top">Imaginative strong use of angles.</td>', 'Imaginative strong use of angles.', '2006-07-04 06:49:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2582629, 354514, 61413, '<td valign="top">There are some fascinating patterns on the furnace door. And the yellow heat-trail curving around the top of the ball of glass is highly evocative of the fierce heat inside.<br/> <br/>I think there are several photos here, trying to get out. But the whole is less than the sum of the parts, unfortunately. If you had managed to capture just the ball of glass inside the furnace, with that yellow heat flow, you could have had a great shot.</td>', 'There are some fascinating patterns on the furnace door. And the yellow heat-trail curving around the top of the ball of glass is highly evocative of the fierce heat inside. I think there are several photos here, trying to get out. But the whole is less than the sum of the parts, unfortunately. If you had managed to capture just the ball of glass inside the furnace, with that yellow heat flow, you could have had a great shot.', '2006-07-04 06:57:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2582636, 354124, 61413, '<td valign="top">A pretty un-PC play on words, but it gave me a smile.</td>', 'A pretty un-PC play on words, but it gave me a smile.', '2006-07-04 06:59:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2582647, 354633, 61413, '<td valign="top">Evocatively captured. The stark lighting and use of monochrome works well to create a sense of urban blight that goes beyond a mere broken light bulb.</td>', 'Evocatively captured. The stark lighting and use of monochrome works well to create a sense of urban blight that goes beyond a mere broken light bulb.', '2006-07-04 07:01:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2582684, 354267, 61413, '<td valign="top">Nicely done.<br/> <br/>I particularly like the broken curve of the reflection of the right-hand building. It''s rather incongruous given that the buildings are all (presumably) built straight. Something for the eye to ponder...<br/> <br/>I wonder whether you could have framed it so that the high-point of the buildings wasn''t dead-centre of the composition. But then you might have lost the framing effect of the lowermost sills at the bottom and right edge. Could you have cropped it to get a similar framing effect on the left, too?<br/> <br/>It''s a shame that the sky is bleached out. Maybe the shot would''ve worked better at a different time of day?<br/> <br/>For all that, it''s still a fine shot.</td>', 'Nicely done. I particularly like the broken curve of the reflection of the right-hand building. It''s rather incongruous given that the buildings are all (presumably) built straight. Something for the eye to ponder... I wonder whether you could have framed it so that the high-point of the buildings wasn''t dead-centre of the composition. But then you might have lost the framing effect of the lowermost sills at the bottom and right edge. Could you have cropped it to get a similar framing effect on the left, too? It''s a shame that the sky is bleached out. Maybe the shot would''ve worked better at a different time of day? For all that, it''s still a fine shot.', '2006-07-04 07:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2582709, 353587, 61413, '<td valign="top">Great idea, well executed.</td>', 'Great idea, well executed.', '2006-07-04 07:23:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2582716, 354699, 27482, '<td valign="top">Cool shot, like the simplicity about it, gave a 7.</td>', 'Cool shot, like the simplicity about it, gave a 7.', '2006-07-04 07:26:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2582718, 354361, 27482, '<td valign="top">I would have liked this image better had you used a warmer wb tone to give a more appealing skintone but that is one scary looking ring, does she punch you often with it?  Surprised this didn´t have camera shake, hehe :)</td>', 'I would have liked this image better had you used a warmer wb tone to give a more appealing skintone but that is one scary looking ring, does she punch you often with it?  Surprised this didn´t have camera shake, hehe :)', '2006-07-04 07:27:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2582722, 354530, 61413, '<td valign="top">A nice idea. The shot is well framed, and taking the "black and white" theme right through the cruets'' contents, the title and the choice of monochrome reproduction is good.<br/> <br/>It''s a shame that the detail is kinda washed out in the middle by the backlight, and that you didn''t have sufficient depth of field to keep the pepper kernels in focus.</td>', 'A nice idea. The shot is well framed, and taking the "black and white" theme right through the cruets'' contents, the title and the choice of monochrome reproduction is good. It''s a shame that the detail is kinda washed out in the middle by the backlight, and that you didn''t have sufficient depth of field to keep the pepper kernels in focus.', '2006-07-04 07:27:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2582723, 353980, 27482, '<td valign="top">Kindof dark for my taste and I am not really fond of the lighting at all, sorry :(  Just wanted to tell you why I gave it a 4.</td>', 'Kindof dark for my taste and I am not really fond of the lighting at all, sorry :(  Just wanted to tell you why I gave it a 4.', '2006-07-04 07:27:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2582726, 354365, 27482, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, love the lighting and the quality of this with the exception of the glare on the object that is overexposed and the upper left corner is very good, good enough for a commercial.  7 from me.</td>', 'Nice shot, love the lighting and the quality of this with the exception of the glare on the object that is overexposed and the upper left corner is very good, good enough for a commercial.  7 from me.', '2006-07-04 07:29:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2582727, 353207, 61413, '<td valign="top">Strong use of colours, and an effective tight composition. Nice.</td>', 'Strong use of colours, and an effective tight composition. Nice.', '2006-07-04 07:29:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2582734, 352289, 48228, '<td valign="top">Clever.....</td>', 'Clever.....', '2006-07-04 07:31:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2582735, 354537, 61413, '<td valign="top">I think you''ve worked the properties of the glass quite powerfully here - both the refraction of the clear glass and the transluscence of the frosted glass. It creates a pleasing effect. The contrast with the red background works well too, as does the fade from bright red to black.<br/> <br/>The subject does look just a little "plonked in the centre", though.</td>', 'I think you''ve worked the properties of the glass quite powerfully here - both the refraction of the clear glass and the transluscence of the frosted glass. It creates a pleasing effect. The contrast with the red background works well too, as does the fade from bright red to black. The subject does look just a little "plonked in the centre", though.', '2006-07-04 07:31:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2582739, 353960, 61413, '<td valign="top">Aren''t bottles for containing liquid?</td>', 'Aren''t bottles for containing liquid?', '2006-07-04 07:33:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2582741, 352532, 61413, '<td valign="top">Too busy for me, I''m afraid...</td>', 'Too busy for me, I''m afraid...', '2006-07-04 07:34:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2582751, 353433, 61413, '<td valign="top">There''s a lot I like about this shot. The mix of clear and frosted glass, allowing for transluscence, refraction and reflection to all feature. The strong contrast between left and right. The way the refraction allows light to travel into the "dark" side, and vice versa.<br/> <br/>But does it need to be so nearly symmetrical? And vertical? And square? Maybe you tried other positioning, and it didn''t work so well...</td>', 'There''s a lot I like about this shot. The mix of clear and frosted glass, allowing for transluscence, refraction and reflection to all feature. The strong contrast between left and right. The way the refraction allows light to travel into the "dark" side, and vice versa. But does it need to be so nearly symmetrical? And vertical? And square? Maybe you tried other positioning, and it didn''t work so well...', '2006-07-04 07:39:04.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(2582763, 354225, 61413, '<td valign="top">Very nearly spot-on. The composition, the framing, the angle, the depth of field (just narrow enough), the white-point (bleaching out whatever is above the lens barrels) - all great. The three lense barrels lead the eye nicely down to the specimen on the slide - inspired.<br/> <br/>I wonder, though, if the lense barrels could''ve been cleaned up a bit for the shot. And some of the specs of dust cleaned away from around the slide.<br/> <br/>Picky, picky, picky...</td>', 'Very nearly spot-on. The composition, the framing, the angle, the depth of field (just narrow enough), the white-point (bleaching out whatever is above the lens barrels) - all great. The three lense barrels lead the eye nicely down to the specimen on the slide - inspired. I wonder, though, if the lense barrels could''ve been cleaned up a bit for the shot. And some of the specs of dust cleaned away from around the slide. Picky, picky, picky...', '2006-07-04 07:45:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2582774, 351327, 61413, '<td valign="top">What can I say? A masterpiece. This is surely heading for a ribbon.<br/> <br/>I''d love to hear the story of how this shot was taken.<br/> <br/>The only minor (minor, minor!) thing that bugs me a little about this is the double-reflection. But if I get to take one shot this good in my life, then I''ll die a happy man...</td>', 'What can I say? A masterpiece. This is surely heading for a ribbon. I''d love to hear the story of how this shot was taken. The only minor (minor, minor!) thing that bugs me a little about this is the double-reflection. But if I get to take one shot this good in my life, then I''ll die a happy man...', '2006-07-04 07:51:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2582802, 354480, 61413, '<td valign="top">An absorbing study in distorted reflections. I wonder, though, if it would have worked better in colour?</td>', 'An absorbing study in distorted reflections. I wonder, though, if it would have worked better in colour?', '2006-07-04 07:58:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2582819, 354420, 61413, '<td valign="top">This is a really photogenic piece of glass, and you''ve chosen a good setting for the shot. But it needs more lighting to really make it stand out, I think.</td>', 'This is a really photogenic piece of glass, and you''ve chosen a good setting for the shot. But it needs more lighting to really make it stand out, I think.', '2006-07-04 08:02:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2582829, 354490, 61413, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed. Good lighting. It all comes together and works well.<br/> <br/>Is that a reflection of a flourescent light at the bottom?</td>', 'Nicely composed. Good lighting. It all comes together and works well. Is that a reflection of a flourescent light at the bottom?', '2006-07-04 08:05:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2582842, 351744, 61413, '<td valign="top">The effect from the surface that the glasses are resting on is great. It''s a shame that the focus on the specs isn''t sharper.</td>', 'The effect from the surface that the glasses are resting on is great. It''s a shame that the focus on the specs isn''t sharper.', '2006-07-04 08:09:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2582851, 354084, 27482, '<td valign="top">I have never been a fan of abstract work so take this comment with that in mind but this does absolutely nothing for me, all I see is an out of focus colorful object that is somewhat pixelated, gave this a 4.</td>', 'I have never been a fan of abstract work so take this comment with that in mind but this does absolutely nothing for me, all I see is an out of focus colorful object that is somewhat pixelated, gave this a 4.', '2006-07-04 08:11:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2582977, 354220, 61413, '<td valign="top">Stunning. The strong opposing curves couldn''t be better framed. The pattern in the blue is entrancing. And I love the way the string of bulbs provides a counterpoint to the prevaling darkness of the lwoer portion of the shot.<br/> <br/>This one is going in my favourites...</td>', 'Stunning. The strong opposing curves couldn''t be better framed. The pattern in the blue is entrancing. And I love the way the string of bulbs provides a counterpoint to the prevaling darkness of the lwoer portion of the shot. This one is going in my favourites...', '2006-07-04 08:35:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2582992, 354548, 61413, '<td valign="top">A few simple elements - prepared, presented and composed beautifully. I''m taking notes...</td>', 'A few simple elements - prepared, presented and composed beautifully. I''m taking notes...', '2006-07-04 08:40:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2582994, 354746, 61413, '<td valign="top">A powerfully poignant composition, imparting a strong sense of sadness and separation. Beautiful.<br/> <br/>The low light on the hand really emphasises the sense of there being a barrier, which is further enhanced by the imperfections on the glass in front of the face. And since the boy is clearly in the sunlight, while we are not, there''s a strong sense that it is the viewer who has been isolated, not the boy.<br/> <br/>I could sit and look at this for ages. I have, in fact.</td>', 'A powerfully poignant composition, imparting a strong sense of sadness and separation. Beautiful. The low light on the hand really emphasises the sense of there being a barrier, which is further enhanced by the imperfections on the glass in front of the face. And since the boy is clearly in the sunlight, while we are not, there''s a strong sense that it is the viewer who has been isolated, not the boy. I could sit and look at this for ages. I have, in fact.', '2006-07-04 08:40:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2583121, 352785, 57628, '<td valign="top">Really neat photograph, but I think it would''ve been MUCH better without the piece of construction equipment on the side.</td>', 'Really neat photograph, but I think it would''ve been MUCH better without the piece of construction equipment on the side.', '2006-07-04 09:18:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2583255, 354546, 61318, '<td valign="top">I love everything about this...</td>', 'I love everything about this...', '2006-07-04 09:51:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2583271, 352697, 19507, '<td valign="top">Good use of reflection.  Nicely enough done that, without your title. you have to look closely to even realize it is a reflection.</td>', 'Good use of reflection.  Nicely enough done that, without your title. you have to look closely to even realize it is a reflection.', '2006-07-04 09:54:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2583272, 352406, 19507, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition and unusual shot.  The fact that you chose to shoot this in the rain adds interest to the photo.</td>', 'Interesting composition and unusual shot.  The fact that you chose to shoot this in the rain adds interest to the photo.', '2006-07-04 09:54:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2583275, 354404, 19507, '<td valign="top">Good idea and great color.  I think I would prefer that the marble on the lower left were either 100% included or were cropped out of the shot entirely, but overall a nice shot.</td>', 'Good idea and great color.  I think I would prefer that the marble on the lower left were either 100% included or were cropped out of the shot entirely, but overall a nice shot.', '2006-07-04 09:55:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2583277, 354651, 19507, '<td valign="top">Interesting, simplistic composition and good use of the reflection and color.</td>', 'Interesting, simplistic composition and good use of the reflection and color.', '2006-07-04 09:56:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2583297, 354669, 19507, '<td valign="top">I like the simplicity of this shot, the soft focus and the high key look.</td>', 'I like the simplicity of this shot, the soft focus and the high key look.', '2006-07-04 10:02:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2583298, 353273, 19507, '<td valign="top">Very good color and nice use of reflection.  Reminds me of a landscape at sunrise.</td>', 'Very good color and nice use of reflection.  Reminds me of a landscape at sunrise.', '2006-07-04 10:02:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2583299, 354718, 19507, '<td valign="top">Great color and composition and outstanding abstract shot.</td>', 'Great color and composition and outstanding abstract shot.', '2006-07-04 10:02:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2583300, 354075, 19507, '<td valign="top">Outstanding shot.  Very effective, simple composition, excellent color and detail.</td>', 'Outstanding shot.  Very effective, simple composition, excellent color and detail.', '2006-07-04 10:02:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2583368, 354617, 27482, '<td valign="top">While I normally like shallow dof photos, this one would have appealed more to me if the whole front of the lens were in focus, not jus the bottom part.</td>', 'While I normally like shallow dof photos, this one would have appealed more to me if the whole front of the lens were in focus, not jus the bottom part.', '2006-07-04 10:42:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2583386, 354634, 27482, '<td valign="top">This one is pretty cool, I hope the DNMC nazis are leaving it alone as you now have a liquid in the bulb and the whole point was to photograph glass that wasn´t for holding liquid.  I definately think this fit´s the challenge, very clever, love the lighting and color contrast, only thing I really dislike is the frame but I tried not letting that affect the score wich is 8 from me.</td>', 'This one is pretty cool, I hope the DNMC nazis are leaving it alone as you now have a liquid in the bulb and the whole point was to photograph glass that wasn´t for holding liquid.  I definately think this fit´s the challenge, very clever, love the lighting and color contrast, only thing I really dislike is the frame but I tried not letting that affect the score wich is 8 from me.', '2006-07-04 10:50:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2583390, 354693, 27482, '<td valign="top">Pretty cool shot, love the motion blur effect on it, without it this shot would be pretty static and boring.</td>', 'Pretty cool shot, love the motion blur effect on it, without it this shot would be pretty static and boring.', '2006-07-04 10:51:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2583396, 354531, 27482, '<td valign="top">Nice idea but I think I would have preferred this shot even more if I could see more of the sea and even coastline but having that out of focus and the glasses in focus, you know what I mean?  As it is, the sea is just barely stealing space in the frame and that leads to it stealing my attention.</td>', 'Nice idea but I think I would have preferred this shot even more if I could see more of the sea and even coastline but having that out of focus and the glasses in focus, you know what I mean?  As it is, the sea is just barely stealing space in the frame and that leads to it stealing my attention.', '2006-07-04 10:52:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2583420, 354283, 35530, '<td valign="top">Is this a paperweight?</td>', 'Is this a paperweight?', '2006-07-04 11:03:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2583422, 354365, 35530, '<td valign="top">Great choice of background. Nice lighting.</td>', 'Great choice of background. Nice lighting.', '2006-07-04 11:04:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2583425, 353760, 35530, '<td valign="top">Picture is small. Seems very busy to me. Maybe better without the plant.</td>', 'Picture is small. Seems very busy to me. Maybe better without the plant.', '2006-07-04 11:06:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2583428, 352998, 27482, '<td valign="top">But but but... :-O <br/> <br/>But a nice butt though :)</td>', 'But but but... :-O  But a nice butt though :)', '2006-07-04 11:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2583430, 354069, 27482, '<td valign="top">I can promise you a higher score if you make the most of the allowed 640 pixles dimension.</td>', 'I can promise you a higher score if you make the most of the allowed 640 pixles dimension.', '2006-07-04 11:11:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2583432, 353848, 35530, '<td valign="top">Nice, simple composition. The lighting is a little distracting.</td>', 'Nice, simple composition. The lighting is a little distracting.', '2006-07-04 11:12:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2583433, 354578, 27482, '<td valign="top">I am sorry but this is simply not a very interesting subject to me, is this a last minute submission?  Just doesn´t seem like you spent a lot of effort on this one, I think you can do better.</td>', 'I am sorry but this is simply not a very interesting subject to me, is this a last minute submission?  Just doesn´t seem like you spent a lot of effort on this one, I think you can do better.', '2006-07-04 11:12:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2583435, 354664, 27482, '<td valign="top">Wish this shot had higher image quality, sharper and clearer, any way to make it so, like with a lower iso, faster shutterspeed or something like that?  Would improve it heaps anyway :)</td>', 'Wish this shot had higher image quality, sharper and clearer, any way to make it so, like with a lower iso, faster shutterspeed or something like that?  Would improve it heaps anyway :)', '2006-07-04 11:13:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2583436, 354319, 27482, '<td valign="top">I can promise you will score better if you try keeping your image as close to the max 640 pixles allowed next time.</td>', 'I can promise you will score better if you try keeping your image as close to the max 640 pixles allowed next time.', '2006-07-04 11:14:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2583439, 354663, 27482, '<td valign="top">Pretty cool shot, love the clarity and coloring in it, just wish the lower part was in the DOF too.  7 from me.</td>', 'Pretty cool shot, love the clarity and coloring in it, just wish the lower part was in the DOF too.  7 from me.', '2006-07-04 11:14:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2583441, 354764, 35530, '<td valign="top">Horizon is a little crooked. Although there is glass in this photo, it doesn''t seem to be the main subject.</td>', 'Horizon is a little crooked. Although there is glass in this photo, it doesn''t seem to be the main subject.', '2006-07-04 11:15:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2583442, 353040, 49652, '<td valign="top">Dragon and Lotus Carnival Glass!  Amethyst? I have a collection and thought of photo''ing it for this but didn''t.  This is pretty and CG is very hard to shoot.  A little more light might have really made this pop, especially back lighting I think.</td>', 'Dragon and Lotus Carnival Glass!  Amethyst? I have a collection and thought of photo''ing it for this but didn''t.  This is pretty and CG is very hard to shoot.  A little more light might have really made this pop, especially back lighting I think.', '2006-07-04 11:15:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2583454, 354375, 35530, '<td valign="top">Great lighting. Very nice.</td>', 'Great lighting. Very nice.', '2006-07-04 11:18:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2583457, 354420, 27482, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, needs something extra though for me to score it above 7 but that is exactly what you got from me and that is a high score from me, means I like it :)  Don´t know what´s "missing", can´t put my finger on it.</td>', 'Nice shot, needs something extra though for me to score it above 7 but that is exactly what you got from me and that is a high score from me, means I like it :)  Don´t know what´s "missing", can´t put my finger on it.', '2006-07-04 11:19:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2583458, 354375, 27482, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting in this one, very mysterious.</td>', 'I like the lighting in this one, very mysterious.', '2006-07-04 11:19:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2583464, 354654, 35530, '<td valign="top">Good take on the challenge. Tells a story and conveys lots of emotion.</td>', 'Good take on the challenge. Tells a story and conveys lots of emotion.', '2006-07-04 11:20:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2583466, 354675, 27482, '<td valign="top">Nice job on the lighting, wish it was slightly brighter though, the whole shot and my screen is calibrated but this is very clever, great idea.</td>', 'Nice job on the lighting, wish it was slightly brighter though, the whole shot and my screen is calibrated but this is very clever, great idea.', '2006-07-04 11:20:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2583475, 354209, 35530, '<td valign="top">Great abstract.</td>', 'Great abstract.', '2006-07-04 11:23:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2583482, 352845, 27482, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, still I feel like I am looking at a photo of "nothing", but that´s perhaps just my way of thinking, I immediately saw this setting and thought it would be perfect for a model shoot :)</td>', 'Nice shot, still I feel like I am looking at a photo of "nothing", but that´s perhaps just my way of thinking, I immediately saw this setting and thought it would be perfect for a model shoot :)', '2006-07-04 11:25:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2583483, 354591, 35530, '<td valign="top">Colors and lighting make this one pop out. Good job.</td>', 'Colors and lighting make this one pop out. Good job.', '2006-07-04 11:25:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2583486, 354126, 27482, '<td valign="top">Pretty cool shot!  I really like it, too bad this is basic editing and you couldn´t edit the sky separate, I can just see this with even more dramatic clouds.  7 from me.</td>', 'Pretty cool shot!  I really like it, too bad this is basic editing and you couldn´t edit the sky separate, I can just see this with even more dramatic clouds.  7 from me.', '2006-07-04 11:26:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2583491, 354437, 35530, '<td valign="top">The double shadows are a little distracting in an otherwise nice shot.</td>', 'The double shadows are a little distracting in an otherwise nice shot.', '2006-07-04 11:28:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2583502, 351684, 35530, '<td valign="top">The flare is very distracting.</td>', 'The flare is very distracting.', '2006-07-04 11:33:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2583508, 354435, 35530, '<td valign="top">I would like to see a little more detail in the model. Also, the reflection (light?) spoils a decent shot.</td>', 'I would like to see a little more detail in the model. Also, the reflection (light?) spoils a decent shot.', '2006-07-04 11:36:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2583511, 354605, 35530, '<td valign="top">Great texture.</td>', 'Great texture.', '2006-07-04 11:36:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2583513, 354640, 35530, '<td valign="top">Hope you share how you did this.</td>', 'Hope you share how you did this.', '2006-07-04 11:37:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2583518, 354126, 35530, '<td valign="top">A little bland for my taste. Might be better with a bright sky and just a cloud or two.</td>', 'A little bland for my taste. Might be better with a bright sky and just a cloud or two.', '2006-07-04 11:39:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2583526, 354271, 35530, '<td valign="top">Great colors and clarity. Just a little busy IMHO.</td>', 'Great colors and clarity. Just a little busy IMHO.', '2006-07-04 11:42:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2583529, 353926, 35530, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective. I really like the contrasting textures and colors.</td>', 'Nice perspective. I really like the contrasting textures and colors.', '2006-07-04 11:43:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2583573, 354408, 35530, '<td valign="top">I''ll say. Very interesting find.</td>', 'I''ll say. Very interesting find.', '2006-07-04 12:00:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2583578, 354693, 35530, '<td valign="top">Great exposure of a very difficult shot.</td>', 'Great exposure of a very difficult shot.', '2006-07-04 12:01:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2583581, 354764, 27482, '<td valign="top">Ooooh, to be honest I don´t really think this meets the challenge, even though you have glass in the shot, I don´t really feel the shot is about that.  In short, I feel you took a shot and made it fit the challenge, not the other way around.  However, I just deducted one point for that and thought I should let you know.  <br/> <br/>Shot is pretty nice, would have given it a 6 in a free study so this got a 5 from me this time.</td>', 'Ooooh, to be honest I don´t really think this meets the challenge, even though you have glass in the shot, I don´t really feel the shot is about that.  In short, I feel you took a shot and made it fit the challenge, not the other way around.  However, I just deducted one point for that and thought I should let you know.   Shot is pretty nice, would have given it a 6 in a free study so this got a 5 from me this time.', '2006-07-04 12:02:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2583585, 354433, 27482, '<td valign="top">Nicely simplified and love the composition, just think I would have liked it heaps more if the contrast were boosted up, seems a bit flat as it is now.</td>', 'Nicely simplified and love the composition, just think I would have liked it heaps more if the contrast were boosted up, seems a bit flat as it is now.', '2006-07-04 12:02:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2583596, 354267, 35530, '<td valign="top">Great perspective. Would have liked the sky to pop out a little better. Still very nice job.</td>', 'Great perspective. Would have liked the sky to pop out a little better. Still very nice job.', '2006-07-04 12:08:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2583598, 354119, 27482, '<td valign="top">Ooooh!  Me like :)  Nice effect of the tainted glass, just would have been more artistic to have her nude, hope I don´t sound like a pervert for saying that, just seems more "set up" like this.  If she were nude you could give off the illusion she was in the shower or something like that.  Anyway, I guess I am more of a perv than I thought I was, hehe :)  7 from me, nice shot.</td>', 'Ooooh!  Me like :)  Nice effect of the tainted glass, just would have been more artistic to have her nude, hope I don´t sound like a pervert for saying that, just seems more "set up" like this.  If she were nude you could give off the illusion she was in the shower or something like that.  Anyway, I guess I am more of a perv than I thought I was, hehe :)  7 from me, nice shot.', '2006-07-04 12:09:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2583599, 354651, 35530, '<td valign="top">Nice reflection. Seems a little out of focus.</td>', 'Nice reflection. Seems a little out of focus.', '2006-07-04 12:09:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2583605, 354124, 27482, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, pity the lighting isn´t all that good and also the shot seems to have syndromes of hand shake, was the light not enough for you to get a decent shutterspeed?  Wish this was lit more mysteriously and was crystal clear and sharp, then I really would have liked it.  Anyway, nice idea and keep at it, this is very promising, you just need to work on your technical skills but the imagination and creativity seems to be there.</td>', 'Nice idea, pity the lighting isn´t all that good and also the shot seems to have syndromes of hand shake, was the light not enough for you to get a decent shutterspeed?  Wish this was lit more mysteriously and was crystal clear and sharp, then I really would have liked it.  Anyway, nice idea and keep at it, this is very promising, you just need to work on your technical skills but the imagination and creativity seems to be there.', '2006-07-04 12:11:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2583613, 354618, 35530, '<td valign="top">It always amazes me how some people can take the most mundane objects and turn them into something beautiful. Great lighting. Well done.</td>', 'It always amazes me how some people can take the most mundane objects and turn them into something beautiful. Great lighting. Well done.', '2006-07-04 12:14:19.000000', NULL, 1),
