(2584138, 354157, 12578, '<td valign="top">I would have given an extra point for a more creative crop - had you have not put the roof in the shot and used the corrugated walls of the building to be a frame to the window frame and centered it it would be a much stronger image. Great capture and one of my faves thus far... Hope it does well. 8</td>', 'I would have given an extra point for a more creative crop - had you have not put the roof in the shot and used the corrugated walls of the building to be a frame to the window frame and centered it it would be a much stronger image. Great capture and one of my faves thus far... Hope it does well. 8', '2006-07-04 14:20:54.000000', NULL, 1),
