(2584165, 354212, 12578, '<td valign="top">fantastic capture</td>', 'fantastic capture', '2006-07-04 14:24:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2584262, 352381, 35530, '<td valign="top">This will <b>not</b> be another DNMC comment since "glass" is not immediately evident in this shot. Since we all are adult about the challenge details, I will automatically assume that it is glass of some sort.<br/> <br/>People say that the mark of a good photograph is its ability to hold the viewers attention. You have succeeded remarkable well in that regard. Of all the photos in this large challenge, I have continued to come back and be intrigued by yours.<br/> <br/>There are elements to this photo that I absolutely find amazing. The color is very appealing and I love the overall texture. It almost seems like and ink print on an ancient stone wall. There is almost a "batik" feel to this. It sure does convey the feeling of a Royal Palace from a bygone era.<br/> <br/>The crop is nice. There are great angles to the composition. It would be interesting to see this just a touch brighter, but that is a minor flaw.<br/> <br/>Although it may not be the best of all the entries it certainly deserves a decent score. I hope others can view and appreciate this shot. Regardless of your ultimate score, you have provided a very interesting photo. 8</td>', 'This will not be another DNMC comment since "glass" is not immediately evident in this shot. Since we all are adult about the challenge details, I will automatically assume that it is glass of some sort. People say that the mark of a good photograph is its ability to hold the viewers attention. You have succeeded remarkable well in that regard. Of all the photos in this large challenge, I have continued to come back and be intrigued by yours. There are elements to this photo that I absolutely find amazing. The color is very appealing and I love the overall texture. It almost seems like and ink print on an ancient stone wall. There is almost a "batik" feel to this. It sure does convey the feeling of a Royal Palace from a bygone era. The crop is nice. There are great angles to the composition. It would be interesting to see this just a touch brighter, but that is a minor flaw. Although it may not be the best of all the entries it certainly deserves a decent score. I hope others can view and appreciate this shot. Regardless of your ultimate score, you have provided a very interesting photo. 8', '2006-07-04 14:45:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2584266, 354640, 29770, '<td valign="top">This shot certainly has some wow factors.  I love the colors and the smooth lines of the glass and liquid.  Very nice shot.</td>', 'This shot certainly has some wow factors.  I love the colors and the smooth lines of the glass and liquid.  Very nice shot.', '2006-07-04 14:46:40.000000', NULL, 1),
