(2585833, 354157, 36371, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all of your comments. I really do appreciate them!! And thanks for the votes, too...<br/> <br/>After challenge comment:<br/>Man, i wish I had entered my first choice. I had it entered and pulled it at the last second. It had none of the elements that everyone was talking about (the fuzzy things blowing around) and the reason I entered the one I dd, was it had better reflections. And wasn''t that what this challenge was all about???<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=359405" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/36371/thumb/359405.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/36371/thumb/359405.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/36371/thumb/359405.jpg"/></a><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-07-06 02:16:09.</i></td>', 'Thanks for all of your comments. I really do appreciate them!! And thanks for the votes, too... After challenge comment:Man, i wish I had entered my first choice. I had it entered and pulled it at the last second. It had none of the elements that everyone was talking about (the fuzzy things blowing around) and the reason I entered the one I dd, was it had better reflections. And wasn''t that what this challenge was all about??? ', '2006-07-05 01:13:31.000000', '2006-07-06 03:16:09.000000', 0),
