(2585850, 354271, 57, '<td valign="top">Wow, I''m thrilled with this result (especially after last week, that entry sucked, lol!).  <br/> <br/>For those of you who commented that this photo is kinda busy....  well, yes it is.  But I debated entering some close-ups of the detail and figured they would be slammed as boring.  And basically the essence of Chihuly''s work IS that it invites to you in to visually wander around, and I think this photo captures that feeling.  Amazingly, this is the first shot I took of this display, the others were not nearly as good.  I only bumped up the saturation and brightness/contrast a little.</td>', 'Wow, I''m thrilled with this result (especially after last week, that entry sucked, lol!).   For those of you who commented that this photo is kinda busy....  well, yes it is.  But I debated entering some close-ups of the detail and figured they would be slammed as boring.  And basically the essence of Chihuly''s work IS that it invites to you in to visually wander around, and I think this photo captures that feeling.  Amazingly, this is the first shot I took of this display, the others were not nearly as good.  I only bumped up the saturation and brightness/contrast a little.', '2006-07-05 01:18:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(2585855, 354075, 48228, '<td valign="top">Excellent image here, and so desertves the blue" ribbon. I can''t believe I actually missed it..... Being a sad and not very healthy week for me, I didn''t get to vote 100% this challenge. (I only manages a 60% vote) Congratulations on this achievement.....</td>', 'Excellent image here, and so desertves the blue" ribbon. I can''t believe I actually missed it..... Being a sad and not very healthy week for me, I didn''t get to vote 100% this challenge. (I only manages a 60% vote) Congratulations on this achievement.....', '2006-07-05 01:19:45.000000', NULL, 0),
