(2586043, 354404, 59065, '<td valign="top">Thank you very much for all the comments and 18th place finish.  This was only my 3rd entry on dpchallenge so I''m pretty happy right now.<br/> <br/>A few things about my picture:<br/> <br/>The bottom marble is cropped by my camera, I tried to crop it out in PS but it took out too much of the cloud and I liked the cloud.<br/> <br/>I started off with 75 marbles and ended with 56. I put a sheet out to catch the marbles but they would hit each other and go flying and I couldn''t find them in the grass.<br/> <br/>It took me around 75+ tosses to get a shot I liked enough to enter.  I had several I liked better with nicer clouds, better marbles but they were out of focus, too clumped etc.  I spent about 3+ hours on this shot.<br/> <br/>I wanted to mess with fast shutter speeds so that''s why I picked what I did, it was fun but WAY more difficult than I thought it would be.<br/> <br/>Thank you again for the feedback and high scores.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-07-05 00:56:31.</i></td>', 'Thank you very much for all the comments and 18th place finish.  This was only my 3rd entry on dpchallenge so I''m pretty happy right now. A few things about my picture: The bottom marble is cropped by my camera, I tried to crop it out in PS but it took out too much of the cloud and I liked the cloud. I started off with 75 marbles and ended with 56. I put a sheet out to catch the marbles but they would hit each other and go flying and I couldn''t find them in the grass. It took me around 75+ tosses to get a shot I liked enough to enter.  I had several I liked better with nicer clouds, better marbles but they were out of focus, too clumped etc.  I spent about 3+ hours on this shot. I wanted to mess with fast shutter speeds so that''s why I picked what I did, it was fun but WAY more difficult than I thought it would be. Thank you again for the feedback and high scores.', '2006-07-05 01:55:30.000000', '2006-07-05 01:56:31.000000', 0),
(2586047, 354640, 42567, '<td valign="top">One of the coolest pictures I''ve seen on DPC!  Great job</td>', 'One of the coolest pictures I''ve seen on DPC!  Great job', '2006-07-05 01:55:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(2586071, 354075, 39849, '<td valign="top">I loved this shot, Congrats!!!</td>', 'I loved this shot, Congrats!!!', '2006-07-05 02:00:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(2586086, 354231, 41799, '<td valign="top">Call me a nerd but this totally brings to mind the Palantri of Tolkien''s Middle Earth.<br/> <br/>As for the photo itself, absolutely beautiful. I am very intrigued as to the real size of the sphere, I know that its visual equivalence to the rock is an illusion but I wonder by how much (bowling ball or marble). Either way, very nicely done.</td>', 'Call me a nerd but this totally brings to mind the Palantri of Tolkien''s Middle Earth. As for the photo itself, absolutely beautiful. I am very intrigued as to the real size of the sphere, I know that its visual equivalence to the rock is an illusion but I wonder by how much (bowling ball or marble). Either way, very nicely done.', '2006-07-05 02:02:41.000000', NULL, 0),
