(2586858, 354548, 56840, '<td valign="top">Wow, I''m very happy about the result :D This was my first submission to DPC (or any photography challenge for that matter) ever, and I can''t believe how it turned out. I have to thank everyone who voted and commented on my picture.<br/> <br/>About the red/yellow area in the bottom left, I have no clue as to how that can be made into the same blue that you can see in front of the green apples, with Basic editing rules only. Everything I tried ruined the red apple. Would have done a retake with different light setup if there was time.<br/> <br/>I also have to add that DPC is one of the biggest sources of inspiration for me when it comes to photography, and I am learning incredibly much from this site! Thanks everyone :)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-07-06 09:17:22.</i></td>', 'Wow, I''m very happy about the result :D This was my first submission to DPC (or any photography challenge for that matter) ever, and I can''t believe how it turned out. I have to thank everyone who voted and commented on my picture. About the red/yellow area in the bottom left, I have no clue as to how that can be made into the same blue that you can see in front of the green apples, with Basic editing rules only. Everything I tried ruined the red apple. Would have done a retake with different light setup if there was time. I also have to add that DPC is one of the biggest sources of inspiration for me when it comes to photography, and I am learning incredibly much from this site! Thanks everyone :)', '2006-07-05 08:09:02.000000', '2006-07-06 10:17:22.000000', 0),
