(2588453, 354542, 60396, '<td valign="top">Thank you for all your comments.  I have started to use photoshop to great effect. Have been using this on some previous photos and am amazed at the difference to be gained.  Ref the last comment before close of voting: I have checked the photo and as far as I am able to ascertain a large proportion of this photo is in focus.  Sorry that you were unable to see that.</td>', 'Thank you for all your comments.  I have started to use photoshop to great effect. Have been using this on some previous photos and am amazed at the difference to be gained.  Ref the last comment before close of voting: I have checked the photo and as far as I am able to ascertain a large proportion of this photo is in focus.  Sorry that you were unable to see that.', '2006-07-05 15:52:20.000000', NULL, 0),
