(2588514, 352859, 36382, '<td valign="top">Thank you Zoomdak and Sherpet.  Also thanks for your note Sherpet.  I''m glad you liked the shot.  I am pleasantly surprised though that it came in tenth.</td>', 'Thank you Zoomdak and Sherpet.  Also thanks for your note Sherpet.  I''m glad you liked the shot.  I am pleasantly surprised though that it came in tenth.', '2006-07-05 16:15:25.000000', NULL, 0),
