(2589966, 354217, 29011, '<td valign="top">Such a nice shot. I didn''t get to leave a comment during the voting period but I like this photo a whole lot. The clarity, crop and color (3c''s ;)) are what I like most. I see this is your 3rd challenge, keep posting :)</td>', 'Such a nice shot. I didn''t get to leave a comment during the voting period but I like this photo a whole lot. The clarity, crop and color (3c''s ;)) are what I like most. I see this is your 3rd challenge, keep posting :)', '2006-07-05 20:31:01.000000', NULL, 0),
