(2590795, 353158, 12750, '<td valign="top">I love this shot. The warm color of the sun showing through the ball like moving fire does it for me. Feels alive! It actually reminds me of the palantir from LOTR movie, same effect!<br/> <br/>Definately should''ve been on the front page. :)</td>', 'I love this shot. The warm color of the sun showing through the ball like moving fire does it for me. Feels alive! It actually reminds me of the palantir from LOTR movie, same effect! Definately should''ve been on the front page. :)', '2006-07-05 23:48:32.000000', NULL, 0),
