(2590999, 354657, 30982, '<td valign="top">Trading Post comment<br/> <br/>I remember this one from voting - I''m pretty sure I said something about it being a bit too red, though I did think it was red to signify death.  I think this was a good choice for the challenge and I like the pieces lined up but not fully visible on each side.  Technically, it seems a little soft, but I kinda like soft.  The pieces in the upper right seem sharper than those in the center, though, which implies the focus was just a tad closer to that corner than the center pieces.</td>', 'Trading Post comment I remember this one from voting - I''m pretty sure I said something about it being a bit too red, though I did think it was red to signify death.  I think this was a good choice for the challenge and I like the pieces lined up but not fully visible on each side.  Technically, it seems a little soft, but I kinda like soft.  The pieces in the upper right seem sharper than those in the center, though, which implies the focus was just a tad closer to that corner than the center pieces.', '2006-07-06 00:42:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(2591003, 354640, 61383, '<td valign="top">And the Slipster pwneth !!! :D</td>', 'And the Slipster pwneth !!! :D', '2006-07-06 00:43:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(2591068, 353479, 30982, '<td valign="top">Trading Post comment<br/> <br/>I remember this one from voting - I thought you achieved the goal implied by the title very well.  I suspect the majority of voters didn''t like the processing and perceived it as "overdone" rather than intentional.  I really like the way it fades to dark on the right - sort of "uncharted territory" in that direction!</td>', 'Trading Post comment I remember this one from voting - I thought you achieved the goal implied by the title very well.  I suspect the majority of voters didn''t like the processing and perceived it as "overdone" rather than intentional.  I really like the way it fades to dark on the right - sort of "uncharted territory" in that direction!', '2006-07-06 01:01:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(2591090, 352697, 30982, '<td valign="top">Trading Post comment<br/> <br/>I gave this a 7 - I really like the neutral tones and the balance this has.  In looking at it again, I also think it''s kinda neat how the center flame is the strongest, particularly in the reflection.</td>', 'Trading Post comment I gave this a 7 - I really like the neutral tones and the balance this has.  In looking at it again, I also think it''s kinda neat how the center flame is the strongest, particularly in the reflection.', '2006-07-06 01:04:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(2591179, 352779, 30982, '<td valign="top">Trading Post comment<br/> <br/>What I said the first time through.  :-)  Simple, clean lines; nice gradation in the sky, too.</td>', 'Trading Post comment What I said the first time through.  :-)  Simple, clean lines; nice gradation in the sky, too.', '2006-07-06 01:18:58.000000', NULL, 0),
