(2592784, 351605, 3724, '<td valign="top">....little fellow a handful. Playful image...  an underrated score for this, very fun foto to view.  I tagged it 7 with one view in voting.  Beautiful presentation, perfect crop &amp; elegant frame for this album gem. I don''t see sharpen in your comments, and it looks as if there is little or none - not sure that sharpen can contribute to the intended impressionistic style anyway.  A very good entry deserving better voter consideration.</td>', '....little fellow a handful. Playful image...  an underrated score for this, very fun foto to view.  I tagged it 7 with one view in voting.  Beautiful presentation, perfect crop & elegant frame for this album gem. I don''t see sharpen in your comments, and it looks as if there is little or none - not sure that sharpen can contribute to the intended impressionistic style anyway.  A very good entry deserving better voter consideration.', '2006-07-06 10:30:21.000000', NULL, 0),
