(2595041, 354393, 20488, '<td valign="top">Good selection dude and good one for the first attempt. Good use of lighting- it creates the nice dark environment, although I''d have the lighting to be uniform across the sculputure, espicially on the girl''s right palm/hand. Also, the faces and the positioning are distracting me away to that glowing thing in the background. I''d have rated 6.<br/></td>', 'Good selection dude and good one for the first attempt. Good use of lighting- it creates the nice dark environment, although I''d have the lighting to be uniform across the sculputure, espicially on the girl''s right palm/hand. Also, the faces and the positioning are distracting me away to that glowing thing in the background. I''d have rated 6.', '2006-07-06 22:06:48.000000', NULL, 0),
