(2595916, 354640, 29904, '<td valign="top">Heya Slippy!  Muchos Congrats to you for your first OVER-DUE ribbon!!! and a huge 7+ !!!  Excellent execution!!<br/>Happened like this for me a few months ago and havn''t had time to participate since.  Came out of hiding just to congratulate you!  :)</td>', 'Heya Slippy!  Muchos Congrats to you for your first OVER-DUE ribbon!!! and a huge 7+ !!!  Excellent execution!!Happened like this for me a few months ago and havn''t had time to participate since.  Came out of hiding just to congratulate you!  :)', '2006-07-07 02:58:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(2595917, 354659, 54540, '<td valign="top">Interesting point made by Melethia.<br/>If you crop just the top edge of the frame out, so that the upper most diamond is open to the sky - frameless if you will - it creates another good finish to the image, IMHO.</td>', 'Interesting point made by Melethia.If you crop just the top edge of the frame out, so that the upper most diamond is open to the sky - frameless if you will - it creates another good finish to the image, IMHO.', '2006-07-07 02:58:46.000000', NULL, 0),
