(2596661, 354346, 49447, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all the helpful comments, especially dahkota''s.  Even though I used Curves &amp; Sharpening, when I increased curves, then sharpening (by a factor of 10) it really made the picture so much better.  Sorry it took so long to post this, my computer modem has been having problems.</td>', 'Thanks for all the helpful comments, especially dahkota''s.  Even though I used Curves & Sharpening, when I increased curves, then sharpening (by a factor of 10) it really made the picture so much better.  Sorry it took so long to post this, my computer modem has been having problems.', '2006-07-07 10:14:09.000000', NULL, 0),
