(2597253, 354231, 37893, '<td valign="top">Congrats on another ribbon! I guess you can''t live without Cannon Beach :) This is a sweet photo and even improved by the post processing.</td>', 'Congrats on another ribbon! I guess you can''t live without Cannon Beach :) This is a sweet photo and even improved by the post processing.', '2006-07-07 12:35:52.000000', NULL, 0),
