(2610658, 353483, 22781, '<td valign="top">Critique club Comment,<br/> <br/>Hi from the Critique Club.<br/> <br/>I think this image could have scored a lot better if you had done some things different.<br/>Let me explain.<br/>The flowers and the blue glass vase are nice, and if you would have framed it different, and focus it better, this would have been a nice image.<br/>To be honest I cant find any point in this pic that is in real focusm or maybe this is motion blur?<br/>The right top of the picture is also blown out.<br/>The DPC voters tend to like sharp photos.<br/>But dont give up, youll see you will get better and better here at DPC.<br/></td>', 'Critique club Comment, Hi from the Critique Club. I think this image could have scored a lot better if you had done some things different.Let me explain.The flowers and the blue glass vase are nice, and if you would have framed it different, and focus it better, this would have been a nice image.To be honest I cant find any point in this pic that is in real focusm or maybe this is motion blur?The right top of the picture is also blown out.The DPC voters tend to like sharp photos.But dont give up, youll see you will get better and better here at DPC.', '2006-07-11 10:39:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(2610693, 353800, 22781, '<td valign="top">Critique club Comment,<br/> <br/>Hi from the Critique Club.<br/> <br/>I like the title, I also have an image in my portfolio with the same name, but a different subject ;)<br/> <br/>I really like the emotion in this picture, however I would have liked to see a bit more of her face.<br/>Also the umbrella (I dont know the right word) in the top of the picture is a bit distracting.<br/>I personally would have tried to up the saturation and contrast slightly, and maybe sharpen it a bit more, just to give it a little bit more impact.<br/>All in all a nice picture,<br/> <br/>Keep up the good work.<br/> <br/>Peter<br/></td>', 'Critique club Comment, Hi from the Critique Club. I like the title, I also have an image in my portfolio with the same name, but a different subject ;) I really like the emotion in this picture, however I would have liked to see a bit more of her face.Also the umbrella (I dont know the right word) in the top of the picture is a bit distracting.I personally would have tried to up the saturation and contrast slightly, and maybe sharpen it a bit more, just to give it a little bit more impact.All in all a nice picture, Keep up the good work. Peter', '2006-07-11 11:03:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(2610725, 353848, 22781, '<td valign="top">Critique club Comment,<br/> <br/>Hi from the Critique Club.<br/> <br/>This is not a bad picture, and theres not realy much I could say to improve this. However, as commented I too would like to see all 3 marbles in the picture, and make it more visual interesting, just to get that WOW effect.<br/>I like the reflections in the glass, I see 1 with a face, 1 with a head and 1 with an eye. Bit creepy too :b<br/>Hope this helps you in any way.<br/> <br/>Keep up the good work.<br/> <br/>Peter<br/></td>', 'Critique club Comment, Hi from the Critique Club. This is not a bad picture, and theres not realy much I could say to improve this. However, as commented I too would like to see all 3 marbles in the picture, and make it more visual interesting, just to get that WOW effect.I like the reflections in the glass, I see 1 with a face, 1 with a head and 1 with an eye. Bit creepy too :bHope this helps you in any way. Keep up the good work. Peter', '2006-07-11 11:20:01.000000', NULL, 0),
