(2616082, 354746, 48890, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by locutus:</b></div><hr/><i> A powerfully poignant composition, imparting a strong sense of sadness and separation.</i></td></tr></table> <br/>Yes, separation is the word.  A striking image, very disturbing and moving.  The eye contact and the open palm imply strong connection, and the dirty glass severs it. One gets similar feeling from some Bergman movies.</td>', 'Originally posted by locutus: A powerfully poignant composition, imparting a strong sense of sadness and separation. Yes, separation is the word.  A striking image, very disturbing and moving.  The eye contact and the open palm imply strong connection, and the dirty glass severs it. One gets similar feeling from some Bergman movies.', '2006-07-12 19:27:16.000000', NULL, 0),
